<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h">Tasinɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vi shɔ tasi Yɔhana yɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tasine</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tas</para>
  <para style="mt1">Vitasinɛ a Shɔ Tasi Yɔhana</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Vitasinɛ a shɔ tasi yɔhana yɛ</char> shɔ bee a ɗagbete kirisayi a ɗɔ raɓoonɛ aru i pɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Yesɔ kirisi Uɓeyelapa bi . Shɔu bee labeenɛm kasi nɛn ã shɔu yɛ ɓali labeenem kaka bimasinɛ a sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ, i ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a ɗagbete i kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔ bintanɛyɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Vi gaanɛ au a yɛti labeenɛm pɛ vitasinɛ a vizɛnɛ a shɔ tasi a nyakoo a kirisa gbete i si ɗawuni i si zɛyɛ, ama si yɛ ɔ̃kɛ vi yuuyɔrinɛ a zɔ gãsiyi ɗɔbii piti. Ji naa gbeteu si a yuunyawanɛ aru ruumanɛ, yuunyawanɛ labeenɛm shɔ pasitɔ ano pasinɛ a nyaba vizɛnɛ tottot. Ama shɔ ruu zɛnɛtɔ aɗɔn tottot aru labeenɛm dɔɔtanɛni, ama yuunyawanɛ gaanɛ tɔɗɔn wasak: aka Kirisi Ubeyelapa, Ɗa yɛ lɔu shɔ nɔpɔ̃yitɔ piti kpai au yisinɛni, a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ni piti, yɛ shori u shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi nazãtɔ a kolapa sɔɔ a kotipi sɔɔni a ɗa au ɗasharinɛ kɛ yiinɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yuutasinɛ (1:1-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɓeline vitasine a sẽkoo yenɛ Ɗawere manzi (1:9-3.22)</para>
  <para style="io1">sẽkoo linɛ a shɔ reunya ɗɔ manzi (4:1-8.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Gãnti manzi (8.2-11.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɔɔ au ge yaa a viɓili ziti (12.1-13.18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Vitasine tottot (14.1-15.8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɗalapa japii manzi a sisɨn lɛsine (16:1-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Babila lesine a viɓili lone, janyagadi nyayelineyi, a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ (17:1-20.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ruuyene nyayisine (20:11-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kolapa sɔɔ, kotipi sɔɔ, a Urushelima sɔɔ (21.1-22.5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisine (22.6-21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />N pɛ Labeenɛ au tuu vibeenɛ a Yesɔ krisi shɛshi shɔyɛ. Ɗalapa ãu vitasinɛm u tasiu jawɛrɛyitɔ pɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa yɛ pɛlitɔ. Kirisi pɔ̃ vim shɔ zɛrɛ a nyaɓa gbete shou Ɗajashonɛlapa yɛnɛ u jawɛrɛ Yɔhana ɗɔbii, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Yɔhana sha vigbete zɛyɛtɔ kpai. Shɔm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ u nya shanɛ ayuu Ɗalapa vishanɛ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete Yesɔ Kirisi tasiyɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ɗalapa u tasi shɔ gbete ɓali labeenɛ janyagadim susãritɔ a biini, Ɗalapa u tasi shɔ gbeteyi wesho a janyagadiyi nya susãri abiini ai gɨn vigbete shɔ bee a labeenɛmyɛ! Aruviya ɗaa ɓatɛ maanɛ vim kpai yɛ pɛlitɔ.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Yɛnɛ Kn Shɔ Sisɨn ãnɛyi Ɗɔbii ɗɔ Manzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Nkɔng Yɔhana n ɗɔ sẽkoom beenɛ yɛnɛ kn shɔ sisɨn anɛyi ɗɔbii ɗɔ manzii a tipi Asiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni au shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii u ɔ̃ a ɔkɔɔni, au aɗɔn dɔdɔrim, u siɗɔn tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃, shɔ gbete yɛ a yɛ. A suru manzii ai a ɗekɨn Ɗalapa lakpatim, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />au shɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi ɗɔbii, shɔshinɛkɨnti sisɨn ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn, shɔ gbete gaa yunɛ a saa yɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃ sɔ̃n shɔgbete sã kpati kotipiyɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Ɔriutɔ, au nyaba yuu ãnɛ au vɔyɛ, raautɛ au ruuvini a kpaa gbete tɛɛyɛni. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Pɔ̃utɛ u ɔ̃ lakpati u ɔ̃ shɔlansi u bɛli Ɗalapa u Ɓeye. Bassinɛ a kakani yɛnɛ Yesɔ Kirisi ɗɔbii dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />kɨnnɔɔ pɛ kaanɛ a koonyasi! kopiya yɛ zɛutɔ, piti a shɔgbeteyi ɓauyɛni. Shɔzɛ kotipi kpai i yɛ sɨntɔ au yuuni. U ɔ̃ nankɔ!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />&lt;&lt;Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ gaanɛ a yisinɛni,&gt;&gt;Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa shɔgbete vitɛu kaka ɓayɛ sharɛ, shɔgbete dɔdɔrim u ɗɔn, au si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ aɗɔn, au yɛ a yɛ.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kirisi Vitasinɛ nɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Nkɔng Yɔhana, ɔ ɓɛzɔ̃, shɔu gɨn Yesɔ yɛ, n pɛ ɔ shɔ dɔraanɛ n ji a tete sisɨnmɛɛnɛ a raɓoonɛni au a si shɔ Ɗa lakpati ɔ̃nɛ yɛ. Shɔ pɔ̃ng a doddokanɛ a patimo aru gbete n nwari shɔ Ɗalapa nyaruubii a ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete Yesɔ tasiyɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />A Uɓeyelapa lee, Suru tuurɛ, n nta yeenya a kakani, gbete kaa naa ganti, u ɗɔɔ nyanwanɛ ang kakɨnti. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Nyeenyau shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Bee vigbete a zɛ a labeenɛ a shoshi shɔwɛrɛɗa manziiwiyi labeenɛmtɔ a komoo manzii miyi: kɛ a Afisa a Simirna a pegamum a Tiyatira a Sardi a Filadefiya wɔsɔ̃n Laudikiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />N rinɔɔ n zɛ shɔgbete au nwanya a nkɔniu pɛ ang zɛ laa tarimɛɛ manzii ai sã yaa yɛ, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />atete laa tarimɛɛu n zɛ viwɔɔ shɛ zɔ a shɔzɛ u ɗɔ shinɛ, tosi fãrã gbɛm anɛ jadɔɔdii, u nɔsisɨn shɔ ma a tarimɛɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />U suyuu ayuu puru naa rubu ko naa nyasipuru, u nɔɔ naa ɗeeti yaa; <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />u jadɔɔ naa lasaka nweri au shɔ tou a yaa u ɗɔ kolinɛ, u yeenya kaa naa mii gbete au ɗɔ yunɛyɛ. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Sã sɛ manzii au nakɨn, yere u nya ɗɔ ziti ɗeɗe-ɗeɗe shɛ au nya, u nɔkɨn si kolinɛ naa ɗaa tete niti. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Naa n zɛutɛ, n nwesi au dɔɔ naa shɔu vɔtɛttɔ. A pɔ̃sɨng nakɨn a bi a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkaa ntasetinɛ! N kɔng ɔ̃rɛ gaanɛ a yisinɛni. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete u suru aɗɔn! Sin vɔtɛttɔ, Ama dɔdɔrim n a suruni dangdang. N kaka a yuu vɔrɔni a kotipi gbete vɔrɔ a ɗɔnyɛni <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Aru nankɔ a bee vigbete a nɔɔ zɛyɛ dɔdɔrim a vigbete yɛ a yɛ a ɗekɨn. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Nkɔ dɔɔ ruɓusinɛ e sɛyi manzii gbete ɔ zɛ ang nakɨn, a laa tarimɛɛ manzii au sã yaa yɛ yɛmː sɛyi manzii ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa e kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ manzii, laa tarimɛɛ manzii au sã yaa yɛ, ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ manziiyi.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo yɛnɛ Shɔ sisɨn Ãnɛyi bi a Afisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />&lt;&lt;A beeri Ɗajashonɛlapa kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Afisa nɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ ruu au shɛ a shɔgbeteu sã sɛyi manzii au nakɨn yɛ, au raki atette laatarimɛɛ manzii au sã yaa yɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />&lt;N zɛ vigbete a pɛliyɛ tɛtɔ. n zɛ nɔgbete a shovishonɛ fɛ̃ɛmyɛtɛ, a nɔgbete a mɛɛsisɨnyɛni. N zɛ tɛttɔ a tɛ shɔ gɔnlɔrɔyi naa ɓa, a nta shɔyi tɔnɛ i pɛ jashonɛyi sisɨn tɛttɔ ama i ɓa jashonɛ ɓa, a zɛrɛ i pɛ shɔnyayenɛyi. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />A pɛ shɔ sisɨnmɛɛnɛ, a ɓooraatɛ ang yuuni, ama a ji yɔɔɓa. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ama nkɔ a yukɔnɛ yɛm: A ji ɔrin dɔdɔrim tɔkɨn ɓa nɔgbete a ɔrin siyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Kpaa sisɨn pɛ a nɔgbete a ɔrin siyɛ anɛ aɗagbete a nwesiyɛ! A yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ a pɛlijo vi a gaa pɛlinɛyɛ, a ji yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ ɓa, n yɛn aa ɗɔbiitɔ n tuu laa au sã yaa au ɗɔu ɔ̃yɛni. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ama a kawɔ a pɛli vi tɔ̃vɨntɛ nɔgbete a bɛ̃ɛ̃ Nikolatanyi vishonɛyɛ ji naa n bɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ shoo kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn, ɔ wesho a vigbete Ɗa Suru kɛ geli shɔ sisɨnɛyi nɛ mi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">&lt;&lt;Shɔgbete ɗashariyitɛ, n yɛn ãyi naatɔ i sha nɔlaa au n ti suru au ba a Ɗalapa jaayɛtɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo Yɛnɛ Simirnayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Beeri Ɗajashonɛlapa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Simirnayi nɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ ruu au shɛ a shɔgbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ gaanɛ a nyayisinɛni, shɔu vɔyɛ a ɔ̃ sɔ̃n suruniyɛni. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />N zɛ a yukɔnɛ tɛttɔ; n zɛtɛttɔ a shɔraa-- ama a shɔvinaa nizɛ! N zɛ vikɔ̃linɛ gbete shɔyi tɔnɛyi Yahudawa ama i ɓa i Yadudawa ɓa i sha aa yuuni, i pɛ kn japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃yi! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Mɔkɔ nta setinɛ a raa a yɛ ɓooyɛni. Weshopɛ! shɔlanɛm yɛ ntawɔ sisɨntɔ, yɛ sɨnrɛ shɔ lɔki zɔ gãsiyi a jaahm, ɔ yɛ ɓooraa dɔɔ kopi. Ɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn ang bi, ko shɔ tɔnɛ shɔ nyɔwɔ vɔrɔ, n yɛn ãwɔ suru tɔ au ukɔ ɔ̃kɛrɛ vi ɗasharɔɔ au yuuniyɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Ɔ shoo ntanɛ sitɛ ɗɔn, ɔ wesho a viu Ɗa Suru geli kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ miyi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">&lt;&lt;Shɔgbete ɗashariyitɛ, vɔrɔ au pɛsiyɛ, yɛ ɗiyi naa tɔkɨn a biini ɓa.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sẽkoo Yɛnɛ Pagamum Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />&lt;&lt;A bee vim yɛnɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi bi a Pagamum</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Shɔmpɛ ruu au shɛ a shɔgbete u zali ɗɔn nya kaziti pii-pipi. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />N zɛ ɗɔgbete a ɔ̃ ɗɔnyɛ tɛttɔ, pɛ ɗɔgbete japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ lakpati ɗɔnyɛ. A shɔmni piti a sãn niitɔ katakata, a ji yaa sisɨn ãnɛ ɓa ang biini ɓa, ko a ɗagbete shɔ nyo Antifa n shɔshinɛkɨnti sisɨn ãnɛ tɔ̃vɨn a ɗɔgbete japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ɔ̃yɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ama nkɔ ruuvini a n kpawɔ awuni yɛmː ɔ zɔ gãsiyi awɔ tete i gɨn Balaam vimatinɛ, shɔu mati Balak u pɔ̃ Israilayi i pɛli ruuvini, i shaa vishaanɛ a shɔ nwari vigbete i suru ɓayɛ, i pɛli sɔ̃n kpantang. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Sɔ̃njo nankɔ, shɔwɔyi awɔ tetteni i gɨn Nikolatanyi vimatinɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Dɔdɔrim a yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔǃ A ji yaa ɓa, yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa, n yɛn atɔ n waaba a shɔwiyini a zali gbete shɛ ang nyayɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Ɔ shoo kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn, ɔ wesho a vigbete Ɗa Suru kɛ geli kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi nɛm!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">&lt;&lt; Shɔgbete ɗasharitɛ, n yɛn ãyitɔ atette vishaanɛ a shɔ ɓanɛ manna ang ɓusiyɛni. Kopiya n yɛn ãu sɔ̃n tari puru gbete shɔ bee nii sɔɔ a shɔwɔ ji zɛɓayɛni see shɔgbete au tɛ tariuyɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sẽkoo Yɛnɛ Kn Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi Tiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />&lt;&lt;A bee vim yɛnɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Tiyatira nɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">&lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ ruu au shɛ a Ɗa jaa nya, shɔu nɔɔ naa rɛɛti yaa, u dɔɔ kɔli naa lasaka nweri a shɔ too a yaa yɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />N zɛvi a pɛliyɛ tɛttɔ. N zɛa ɔrinɛ tɛttɔ, aa sisɨn ãnɛni, aa vishonɛni, aa sisɨnmɛɛnɛni. N zɛtɛttɔ a vi pɛlinɛ dɔdɔrim tɛɛ shɔu a pɛli si a ɗekɨn yɛtɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ama shɔmpɛ ruuvini ang kpaa awuni yɛm: a mɛɛsisɨntɛ a suu a shɔ ɓaunɛ Yezɛbelni, shɔ au ɓau yuunɛ Ɗalapa jashonɛ. Au vimatinɛ u ɗɔgbete au shɔlin n shɔ biyiyɛ, sɨnyitɛ nɛi pɛli kpantang wɔsɔ̃n nɛi shaa vishaanɛ a shɔ ã vi shɔ basiyi yɛ ai suru ɓayɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />N ãu dii tɛ u yau ruuvinitɔ, ama ji kasiu kpantang yanɛɓa. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />N yɛn pɔ̃urɛ a shɔgbete i pɛli kpantang a wuni i yɛ ɓooraa fɛ̃ɛm, naa i jo yaa vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ ai pɛli awuni ɓayɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />N yɛn nyo u shɔ gɨnɛyi sɔ̃ntɔ, kɛɗɔn kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi kpai i yɛ zɛttɔ nɛ nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ shɔu zɛ kopiya, shɔ sisɨn a vi pɛlinɛni. N yɛn shori kopiya jo ji nogbete u vishonɛ sãyɛ.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />&lt;&lt;Ama ɔ shɔ Tiyatirayi gãsi jo gɨn vimatinɛ kɔ̃linɛm ɓa; ɔ ji mati vigbete shɔ gãsiyi ɓaanɛ &lt;japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ viɓusinɛ gaa nɛm ɓa.&gt; n gelɔɔtɛ n yɛn pɔ̃sɔɔ vikpetinɛ wɔɔɓa. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ama ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ sãwɔ sisɨn ãnɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm seetɛng atɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Shɔgbete ɗashariyitɛ, i kɛ gɨn vigbete n kasiyɛnɛ yɛnɛ yisinɛ, n yɛn ãyi ji kaka gbete ang tɛ a Maye naayɛː n yɛn ãyi kaka i sã shɔ a kopiti kpai. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />I yɛ sã shɔ a labaa lasaka i sãkiyi ɗetɛ-ɗetɛ naa ɓari tɔ̃pɔ̃. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />I yɛ kpaa kaka nagbete n kpaa a Mayɛ ɗɔbii yɛ, n yɛ ãyi wɔsɔ̃n sɛ gadi ɗa kɛ shariyinɛyɛ. <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Aru nankɔ shɔyi sho ntanɛ ɗɔn i nta vigbete Ɗa suru geli kɨn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyitɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo Yɛnɛ Kn Shɔ Sisɨn ãnɛyi a Sardi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />&lt;&lt;A beeri Ɗajashonɛlapa shɔ kn sisɨn ãnɛyi ai Sardi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">&lt;&lt;N pɛ ruu au shɛ a shɔgbete u a Ɗalapa suruni manzii a sɛni manzii. N zɛ vigbete a pɛliyɛ tɛttɔ; shɔ zɛnaa a suruni karaɓa a vɔtɛttɔ! <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Nisinɛ, a masi vigbete a doo a yiniyɛ i bitɔ nɗayi vɔ yisinɛyɛ. Aruviya n zɛrɛ vigbete a pɛliyɛ ɓa tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ ang Ɗalapa ɗekɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Aru nankɔ a kpasisɨntɔ a vigbete shɔ mataayɛ a vigbete a ntayɛni; a gɨnrɛ a yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ. A ji nisi ɓa, n yɛn a naa ɓɔɔ aa ɗɔbii, a yɛ zɛ ɗagbete n yɛn a yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ama shɔ fɛ̃ɛ̃ a Sarji awɔ tete i ji hɨmsiyi fãrã ɓa. Ɔ yɛ raa a nkɔni, a fãrã puruni a bi aruviya ɔ tesi tɛttɔ i pɛli nankɔni. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Shɔgbete ɗashariyitɛ i yɛ tosi fãrã puru jo namikɔ, n yɛn zɔ̃yi nii ɓa a labeenɛ suruni ɓa. A Mayɛ ɗekɨn au Ɗajashonɛlapa ni n yɛn tasitɔ wasa-wasa ntɔ i pɛ n ɓɛɛyi.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />&lt;&lt; Shɔu shoo ntanɛ ɗɔnyɛ, u nta vigbete Ɗa Suru geli kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyitɔ!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo yɛnɛ kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Filadefiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />&lt;&lt; A beeri Ɗajashonɛlapa e kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Filadefiya ruum:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">shɔm pɛ ruu tɔ̃vɨn au shɛ a shɔ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ nyayɛ. U a Dauda saa nyajaani a naa, kɛ ɓeli nyajaanɛ, shɔwɔ kuɓa, kɛ kunɛ shɔwɔ ɓeliɓa. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />N zɛwɔ vi pɛlinɛ tɛttɔ, n zɛwɔ jaa kaka tɛttɔ; ɔ gɨn vimatinɛtɛ ɔ ã sisɨn tɛttɔ ang biini. N ɓeli nyajaatɛ awɔ ɗekɨn ni, a shɔwɔɔ yɛ kudɔɔɓayɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Weshopɛ! Shɔ gãsi gbeteyi japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ knyɛ, shɔ nyayeenɛyi ai tɔnɛ i pɛ Yahudawayi i sɔ̃n ɓa ikɔ ɓa, n yɛn pɔ̃irɛ i ɓaki a yugboti awɔ dɔɔ. I kpai i yɛ zɛtɔ nɛn ɔrɔɔtɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Aru gbete a mɛɛsisɨn a gɨn nya ãsinɛ, n kɔma n yɛn kɔa sɔ̃njo aɗa raaɓoonɛ au kaanɛ a koo yɛ u nta shɔ sisɨn a kotipi piti kpai. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />N yɛn wari yuuɓa n atɔ. Ɔ kɔ vigbete ɔ wunitɔ aruviya shɔwɔ yɛ raawɔ viɗɔwanɛrɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />N yɛn pɔ̃ shɔgbete Ɗa kɛ shariyinɛyɛ i ɔ̃ laazã ang Ɗalapa wɛrɛ, i yɛ yaa ɗɔu tɔkɨn ɓa. N yɛn bee n Ɗalapa nii ai bi ang Ɗalapa nii komoo pẽnɛ̃bani, Urushalima sɔɔ, au yɛ nɔ a kolapa ang Ɗalapa ɗɔɔbii. N yɛn bee wɔsɔ̃n n nii sɔɔ ai biini.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Shɔu sho kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn u wesho a vigbete Ɗa Suru geli kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyiyɛ!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sẽkoo Yɛnɛ kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Lawodokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />&lt;&lt; A beeri Ɗajashonɛlapa e kn shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi Laudokiya nɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">&lt;&lt;Nkɔ ruu au shɛ a shɔu niinɛ Nankɔ nya yɛm, shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a shɔ shinɛkɨnti tɔ̃vɨn, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ gɨn-gɨn vigbete Ɗalapa shɛshi yɛ piti kpai. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />N zɛa vishonɛ tɛttɔ, a ɓa zaza ko shẽshẽ ɓa. Ang kasinɛ a si ɔ̃kɛ gbete atete niǃ <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ama aru gbete a tete, a ɓa shẽshẽ ko zaza ɓa, n yɛn tulaatɔ ang nyani. <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />A shanɛ, &lt;N shɔ vinaa, n toli vitɛttɔ; n vigbete n kasiyɛ aɗɔn kpai.&gt; A ji zɛ ɓa nɛn vi ɓa naani ɓa, shɔraa weze, ntɔ waati a sɔ̃n shɔ nɔɔ gbãti. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />N gelaa tɛttɔ a woo tarimɛɛ ang naa, tarimɛɛ zalak, nogbete a ɔ̃ shɔvinaa yɛ, a woo wɔsɔ̃n fãrã puru a yɛ tosirɛ a kuki a vini awuni. A woo wɔsɔ̃n gãn nɔɔ a ntee aa nɔɔ nɔgbete a yɛ zɛ ɗɔ awuni tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />N lasi shɔgbete n ɔriyɛ n gɔ̃yi yuusho sɔ̃ntɔ, a pɛli tɔ̃vɨn a yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Weshopɛ! Nkɔng shitɛ yɛm a nyajaa n ɗɔ waanɛ; shɔu kɛ ntanɛ kɛ ɓeli nyajaanɛ, n yɛn tou wɛrɛ n shavi a wuni, yɛ sha sɔ̃njo a nkɔni. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Shɔgbete ɗashariyitɛ n yɛn ãyi naa i ɔ̃ ang kabii ang lakpati, ji nagbete ɗasharing yɛ dɔdɔrim n ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a maye lakpati. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />&lt;&lt;Shɔu shoo ɗɔn u nta vigbete Ɗa suru kɛ geli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyinɛyɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bassinɛ a Kolapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />A knti shɔnkɔ n zɛ vitasinɛ wɔ nyajaa ɓelinɛ a kolapa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">N nta yeenya naa n ntasiyɛ, kaa nya naa gãnti. Yeenyau shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Gẽ arɛ yɛm, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨn ang kɔrɔ n tasaa vigbete a yɛ pɛliyɛ a knti vim.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ɗa Suru nɔ ang yuu weze tɛ̃ɛ̃ti a tuunrɛ, n zɛ shɔwɔ aɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a lakpati a kolapa. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />U nɔkɨn si naa tari au saa yuu fɛ̃ɛm a shɔ ɓaanɛ yasipa a kanɛliya, tagãngɗaa knti lakpatiu atette u mii si naa tari zumurutu. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />A ɗɔ gigiliu, lakpati wɔyi siɗɔn bmati atu nɛ̃ɛ̃ti, shɔpẽniyi si sɔ̃njo bmati atu nɛ̃ɛ̃ti i ɔ̃li aɗɔn, i toli fãrã puru aka salabu kpati tarimɛɛ ai yuu. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />A lakpatiukɔ yaa shɛrɛ kɛ kolinɛ shẽshẽku shẽshẽku, vikalinɛ a jalɛ nyakaanɛni. A ɗekɨn lakpatiu laazɔrɔ̃n siɗɔn manzii aɗɔ shaanɛ, ai pɛ Ɗalapa Suru manzii. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Sɔ̃n a ɗekɨn lakpatiuni viwɔ tasi naa zɛlivini wapo, kɔli wasak naa takolo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃ti wɔyi i shili a ɗɔ lakpatiuni i kɨntiu atette kopikapiya, i nɔɔ a ɗekɨn a kɨnti ni. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Shɔu si ɗekɨn tasi naa zɨnggãng; shɔu pɛsiyɛ tasi naa gunapu, e taati au pɛsiyɛ u nɔkɨn naa shɔzɛ nɔkɨn; e nɛ̃ɛ̃ti au pɛsiyɛ u si naa subɔɔ aɗɔ dunɛ. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiu kopishɔpiya u nakoshẽnti ɗɔn mangbete, kopishɔpiya nɔɔ aɗɔn, ɓuzɨn a ɓilini. Niti a zɨbani i ɗɔɔ soo ntɔnɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt;Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, pɛ Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa shɔgbete vitɛu kakaɓayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">shɔu si yɛ, shɔu ɗɔn, a shɔgbete yɛ a yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃timiyi i ntɔ soo bassinɛ a bɛlinɛni, i dɔ̃ri shɔu ɔ̃li a lakpaurɛ, shɔgbeteu ɔ̃nɛ dangdang yɛ. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />shɔpẽniyi bmati atu nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi i nwesi a tipi a shɔu ɔ̃ a lakpatiu ɗekɨn, i bassi shɔu ɔ̃ dangdang yɛrɛ. I loki i salabu kpatiurɛ au ɗekɨn lakpatiu i shanɛ,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />&lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa au Ɗalapa! A yɛtɛtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">a tɛ bassinɛ, banɛ, a kakani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Aruviya mɔkaa shɛshi virɛ piti kpai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">jo a kasinɛni a pɔ̃rɛ i ɔ̃ a suruni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Labeenɛ lini a Jamɛ̃rɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />N zɛ labeenɛ linɛ a shɔu ɔ̃li a lakpati nakɨn; shɔ bee vi au bi kaziti piti shɔ rɛunya ɗɔ maanzii. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />N zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa pɛ̃niba, au lanya a kakani a shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔuyɛ zɛnɔɔ vinyarɛnɛm ɓɛlinɛ, u kali labeenɛ linɛmrɛ piya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ama Shɔwɔɔ ɓa a kolapa ko a kotipi ko a ɓuzɨn kotipini au yɛ ɓeli labeenɛ linɛm u kɨnnɔɔ a ɓuzɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />N sɨnrɛ fɛ̃ɛm, aru shɔ jo kpaa shɔu yɛ zɛnɔɔ labeenɛ linɛu ɓɛlinɛ u kɨnnɔɔ a ɓuzɨn ni ɓa. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Kɛɗɔn shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔpẽniwiyini gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ sɨnnɛ. kɨnnɔɔ pɛ! Zɨgãng au tipi Yahuda, Dauda laduru pɛ̃niba, ɗashaariutɛ, yɛ zɛnɔɔ labeenɛ linɛ e nyarɛnɛ ɗɔ manzii ntaanɛtɔ, u ɓelirɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Jamɛ̃rɛ̃ u ɗɔɔ shinɛ atette lakpatiwini, vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃ti i kɨntiu atette a shɔpẽniwiyini. Jamɛ̃rɛ̃u tasi naa shɔ nyou tɛttɔ. U laagee maanzii, a nɔɔ maanzii, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa suru maanzii au shoyi a kotipi aɗɔ piti. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Jamɛ̃rɛ̃u yɛrɛ a tuu labeenɛu a shɔgbete ɔ̃li a lakpatiu nakɨn rɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Naa pɛlitɛ nankɔ, vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi a shɔpẽniyi mbati atu nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi i nwesi a tipi a Jamɛ̃rɛ̃u ɗekɨn. Kopishɔpiya u a mhtani a naa, a kosi laa zɨriya sũrũ-sũrũ a pii lot, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi Ɗalapa gakinɛ. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />I ntɔɔ soo sɔɔ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;A yɛtɛtɔ anɔgbete a tuu labeenɛ linɛmrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">a ntaunya a ɓelirɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Aruviya si shɔ nyɔ a vɔrɔ tɛttɔ, a nyaba vɔnɛ gbete a ntee kpaayɛ a raa Ɗalapa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">shɔbiitɛ ko-pi laduru shɔpiya, nyakoo, tipi, a shɛ̃ɛ̃ni.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />A pɔ̃tɛ i ɔ̃ shɔ lakpati shɔlansi ai shoshi u Ɗalapa vishonɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">i kɔyi yɛ sã koorɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />N kɨnnɔɔ sɔnrɛ̃, n nta Ɗajashonɛlapayi nya, lazɔrɔ lazɔrɔ a shɔ gadɔɔ ɓa! I shilirɛ i knti lakpatiu atette a vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi a shɔpeniwiyini, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />i ntɔ soo a gãgãni nɛː</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt; Jamɛ̃rɛ̃ a shɔ nyou yɛ yɛtɛtɔ nɔgbete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">u tɛ kaka, vinaa, sẽrẽ, a lakinɛni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">banɛ, bassinɛ a bɛlinɛni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />N nta vishɛshinɛ piti ai a kolapa, a kotipi a nto kotipi dii, a mii wapo a vi suruyini a kotipi kpai i si a ɗɔɔ soo ntɔnɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">&lt;&lt;Shɔu ɔ̃ a lakpati a Jamɛ̃rɛ̃ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">shɔu bɛliutɔ, shɔu ãu banɛ, bassinɛ a kakani u ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">dangdang!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi i kasinyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nankɔ!&gt;&gt;Shɔpẽniwiyi nwesi a tipi i bassi Ɗalapa rɛ a Jamɛ̃rɛ̃ni.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Jamɛ̃rɛ̃ Ɓeli labeenɛ linɛ Rɛnɛutɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓeli vi gbete shɔ gau nya rɛnɛ atette vi manzii tɛ, n nta yeenya vi suru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi wɔ gbete kaa nya naa jallɛ, nɛ &lt;&lt;Apɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />N kɨnnɔɔ rɛ n zɛ gbɛntɛn puru. U shɔ gẽnɛ sã taa a naa, shɔ ãu salabu kpatitɛ. Shɛ naa shɔgbete ɗashariutɛ yɛ yɛɗɔu ɗashariuyɛ.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Kɛɗɔn jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓeli labeenɛ linɛ rɛnɛ au pɛsiyɛ; ang nta vi suru au pɛsiyɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Apɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Gbɛntɛn wɔ shɛ sɔ̃nrɛ nweri. U shɔ gẽnɛ shɔ ãu kaka nɛu n ti sɨi a kotipi, aru shɔu nyɔki zɔ. Shɔ ãu zaalitɔ pɛ̃niba.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Kɛɗɔn jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓeli labeenɛ linɛ rɛnɛ e taati rɛ; n nta vi suru e taati shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Apɛ!&gt;&gt; N kɨnnɔɔ rɛ n zɛ gbɛntɛn hɨmri. U shɔ gẽnɛ sã vi-vitesinɛ au naa. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />N nta viwɔ kaa nya naa yeenya u ɗɔ anɛ atette visuru nɛ̃ɛ̃ti, au shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Waa visha gbete ayuu viɗɔnwanɛ leegbete, waa visha bale taati ayuu viɗɔnwanɛ leegbete. Ɔkɔɔ lɛsi nɔɔ zetunɛ a mii inabini!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Kɛɗɔn jamɛrɛ̃ ɓeli vi rɛnɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃tiurɛ; n nta yeenya vi suru shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Apɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />N kɨnnɔɔ rɛ n zɛ gbɛntɛntɔ pusang-pusang. U shɔ gẽnɛ shɔ ɓau niinɛ vɔrɔ, kpati kotipi gɨu a knti maani. Shɔ ãyi kakarɛ nɛi sã vigbete atette vi nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a vi kotipi, i nyɔrɛ a nyaba sɨitaanɛ, nwo, vɔrɔbii, a viɓiliyini.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Kɛɗɔn jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓeli virɛnɛ e maani rɛ, n zɛ shɔgbete shɔ nyɔkiyiyɛ suru a ntɔ laazã aru gbeteyi nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii a sisɨn gbete i shi au yuuniyɛ. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />I ɓanya a kakani i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa a vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛ, shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a shɔ tɔ̃vɨn! A yɛ yeeri shɔ kotipi ayi tasiu raa i nyɔkiuyɛ ruu kɛpi ɗavi au yuuni viya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Kopiya shɔ ãyi fãrã puru, shɔ geliyinɛ, nɛi susupɛ sekaa, setɛ i jawɛrɛyi a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi shɔ nyokitɛ kpai, naa shɔ nyoki wɔyi siyɛ. <verse eid="REV 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />N zɛ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓeli virɛnɛ maangbete tɛ. Kɛɗɔn tipi ɓɛ pẽnɛba, a ɗa rii hɨmri naa fãrã hɨmri, shɛlɛ rii nweri kpai naa kpaa. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Sɛyi ɗɔɔ a tipi naa jaa sɨnti gbãnki ɗɔɔyɛ aɗagbete sɔrɔ kɛ shɛnɛ a gãgãniyɛ. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Konyasi nii rɛ naa shɔ livi, ko-pi kɔpɔ shɔpiya a tipi gbete mii kayɛ i gisi kati aɗɔgbete i si ɗɔnni. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Kɛɗɔn kpati kotipiyi, yupɛ̃ni gɔmnatiyi, a yupɛ̃ni sojayini, shɔvinaayi a kaka kiririyi, a shɔ gãsiyini piti kpai, fooyi a shɔgbeteyi ɓa fooyi ɓani, i ɓusiyi yuu a puru a gogotari a kɔpɔ kɔpɔ. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />I ɓaa kɔpɔyi nya a tariyini nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ zɨɨnɛ au bi a ɓusiyitɔ a shɔgbete ɔ̃ a lakpatin ɗekɨn ni, a jamɛ̃rɛ̃ sisɨn lɛsinɛni! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />I lee sisɨn lɛsinɛu atɛ, piyɛ shidɔɔ pi leeuni piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Israila 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />A knti vim n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapayi nɛ̃ɛ̃ti i shi a kawanɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a kotipi, i sã sɔrɔ nɛ̃ɛ̃tim nɔgbete i yɛ shɛ dɔɔɓa a kotipi niɓa, ko a wapo ko a laa wɔni ɓa. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔ u ɗɔ lapa gẽnɛ aka gɨnri sã Ɗalapa au suru ɗɔn u virɛnɛ a naa. A ɓaa Ɗajashonɛlapa nɛɛtiwiyi nya a gãgãni shɔgbete Ɗalapa ãyi kaka vi lɛsinɛ a kotipi a waponiyɛ. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Ɗajashonɛlapau shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkɔ lɛsi kotipinɛ, a waponi, ko laayi, setɛ u pɔ̃si Ɗa jawɛrɛyi naatɛ a virɛnɛ ai nɔɔkɨn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Shɔ gelin nɛ shɔgbete shɔ pɔ̃siyinaayɛ a Ɗalapa virɛnɛ isi (144,000). I sipɛ shɔ Israilayi nyakoo kopi atu ziti. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ko-pi nyakoo shopiya shɔ pɔ̃siyi shɔzɛ lazɔrɔɔ kopi atu ziti naaː shɔ Yahuda, Rubɛn, a Gad ni, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />shɔzɛ lazɔrɔ kopi atu ziti a Asha i nyakoo, Naptali, a Manase ni, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Shɔzɛ lazɔrɔɔ kopi atu ziti a Simeon nyakoo, Lewi, a Isaka ni, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Shɔzɛ laazɔrɔ kopi atu ziti a Zebulun nyakoo, Yusufu, a Benjame ni.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Moo Waanɛ Ko-pi a Tipi shopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />A knti vim n kɨnnɔɔ n zɛ moo waanɛ a shɔ gai dɔɔɓa! I shɛ a tipi tot-tot, a laduru tot-tot, a nyakoo tot-tot, i shi a ɗekɨn lakpati a jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɗekɨn. I tosi fãrã puru i sãli nasẽrẽ laa kãkã ai naa. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />I ɓaanya a gãgãni nɛː &lt;&lt;Raanɛ shɛ au Ɗalapa naa, shɔgbete au ɔ̃ a lakpati, a jamɛ̃rɛ̃ naa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Ɗajashonɛlapayi kpai i shi aɗɔ lakpatiukɔ, shɔpɛ̃niyi a visuru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiyini. Kɛɗɔn i nwesi a ɗekɨn lakpatiu i zuli nɔɔ adi i bassi Ɗalapa rɛ, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nankɔ! Bɛlinɛ, bassinɛ, serẽ, dɔ̃rinɛ, banɛ, kaka, a kaka vishoni u ɔ̃ u Ɗalapa ɓɛɛkɔ dangdang! Nankɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Shɔzɛ gbete atette shɔpẽni hɨnnɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete ai tosi fãrã puru gbɛm miyi ɓɛɛ piwiya? I shɛpi a ɗɔpiya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />N risiunyanɛ&lt;&lt;N ji zɛ ɓa, shɔmala. A zɛtɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">A gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔmpɛ shɔ ai shɛ a raatasinɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃myi naa. I sɔkiyi fãrã tɛ a kpaa jamɛ̃rɛ̃ puru ɓolo-bolo. &lt;&lt; N ji zɛ ɓa, shɔmala. A zɛtɛ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">A gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;N pɛ shɔ ai shɛ a raatasinɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃myi naa. I sɔkiyi fãrã tɛ a kpaa jamɛ̃rɛ̃. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Aruukɔ i shi a ɗekɨn Ɗalapa lakpati, i ɗɔgbete i pɛliu vishonɛ niti a zɨmbani au wɛrɛ Ɗa. Shɔu ɔ̃ a lakpatiu au ɗɔbii yɛ kɔyitɔ. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />I yɛ nta nwo tɔɓa a sutuni ɓa; i yɛ nta ɗaa tonɛ ɓa ko ɗɔɔ shẽshẽ au yɛ rotiyiyɛ ɓa, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />aruviya jamɛ̃rɛ̃ gbete u atette lakpatiu, ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ i shɔ ganɛ, yɛ tɛsiyi ɗekɨn yɛnɛ ɗɔgbete mii suru ɓu aɗɔnyɛ. Ɗalapa yɛ sɔ̃riyi miri a nɔɔ piti kpai.<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Virɛnɛ Maanzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Naa Ɗa jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ɓeli virɛnɛ e manziiutɛ, viwɔ ji gulu ɓa kolapani ɓa mɛnɛ dɔɔɗa ɗiti gbete. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapayi manzii i shitɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, shɔ ãyi gãntitɛ manzii.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔ au a jaɓari tarimɛɛ e laa sũru-sũru a naanyɛ, arɛ a shi a laazã. Shɔ ãu laa sũrũ sũrũ waanɛ nɛu ɓasi a Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi Ɗakinɛni piti, u ã kɛ a laazã tarimɛɛ au shi a lakpati ɗekɨn. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Zɨnri laa sũrũ sũrũ a shɔ too a Ɗajashonɛlapa naa au shi a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn gẽ laparɛ a Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi Ɗagakinɛni. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa tuu jaɓari laa sũrũ-sũrũrɛ, a yisi a yaau a laazã, a lɔkirɛ a kotipi. See ɗɔzɨntirɛ a jalɛ lanɛ, ɗɔ ɓɛshẽku-shẽku, wɔsɔ̃n a tipi ɓɛnɛni.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gãnti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapayi manzii a gãntini i mabiitɛ nɛi geetɔ.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ɗajashonɛlapa ɗekɨn geeu gãntirɛ. tala a yaa, rãa a kpaa tɛ̃ɛ̃ a kotipi. Kotipi kn gbete atette taati yaa sharɛ, laa kn gbete atette taati, a wisi zazani piti kpai.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa au pɛsiyɛ geeu gãntirɛ. Viwɔ tasi naa kɔpɔ pɛ̃niba yaa aɗɔ shaanɛ shɔ lokirɛ a wapo. Wapo kn gbete atette taati rii kpaa rɛ, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />visuru kn gbete atette taati a yɛti wapo vɔrɛ, a latosi pɛ̃nibayi kn gbete atette taati lɛsirɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e taati geeu gãntirɛ. Sɛ pɛ̃niba u yaa ɗɔ shaanɛ naa lazɔrɔn, shi-shi a kolapa a ɓooti kn gbete atette taati a ɗɔgbete mii ɓuyɛ. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />(Sɛu niinɛ, &lt;&lt;Gãgã.&gt;&gt;) Miiwu kn gbete atette taati rii gãgãrɛ, shɔzɛ waanɛ i vɔrɛ aru gbete i ɓoo miiyɛ, aruviya si miiwu rii gãgãtɛ.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e nɛ̃ɛ̃ti geeu gãntirɛ. Vi waa ɗaa kɨn gbete atette taati rɛ, a shɛlɛ kɨn gbete atete taati, a sɛ kɨn gbete atete taatini, aruviya nɔgbete i kɨn gbete atette taatiyi kpaa ɗɔsẽsẽ tɔɓa; ɗɔsẽsẽ si ɓa a kn gbete atette taati a niti ni ɓa, si sɔ̃n jo nankɔ kn gbete atette taati a zɨbani.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Kɛɗɔn n kɨnnɔɔ rɛ, n nta loloki nya a gãgãni au ɗɔ dunɛ a yusɔrɔ shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Wee! wee! yɛ ɔ̃kɛpikovi a ɔkɔɔni shɔ kotipimiyi, aɗagbete gãsi Ɗajashonɛlapa taatimiyi ikɛ mabii gãnti gbete ɔ̃riyitɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ i geetɔ yɛ viya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e maani geeu gãntirɛ. N zɛ sɛ au shishi a kotipi, shɔ ãu saa nyajaa too gbikiri-gbikiri rɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Sɛu ɓeli too gbikiri-gbikiri rɛ, zɨnri shɛrɛ aɗɔn, naa zɨnri yaa gbete shɔ wu too rati; zɨnriu pɔ̃ ɗaa a sɔrɔɔni i rii ɓiti-ɓiti. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Zɔgbayi shɛrɛ a zɨnriuni ai nɔ a kotipi, shɔ ãyi sɔ̃njo kaka gbete neng-yi a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Shɔ geliyinɛ ikɔ ntari wisinɛ ko laa ko viɓaanɛ gãsiyi nɔrɔnɛ; nɛi ntarinɔrɔ ɓɛɛjo shɔgbete i ɓa a Ɗalapa virɛnɛ gbete pɔ̃siyi ai nɔɔkɨn ni ɓa sheeli. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Zɔgbawi shɔ ji yayi ɓa nɛi nyɔ shɔmiyirɛ ɓa, ama i tasiyi ɓɛɛ jo raa shɛllɛ maani sheeli. Kɔnɛ gbete raaɓoonɛu n-tiyɛ ɔ̃ naa kɔnɛ gbete neng tanɛ kɔshɔyɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />A tete shɛlɛ maaniuni i yɛ kãa vɔnɛ, ama i yɛ kpaa ɓa; i yɛ kasi vɔnɛtɔ, ama vɔrɔ yɛ yuuyitɔ.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Zɔgbawi i naa gbɛntɛnyi ai mabiitɛ i ɗɔɔ sɨɨ ganɛ; ai yuu viwɔ aɗɔn tasi naa salabuyi tarimɛɛ, i nɔɔkɨn naa shɔzɛyi nɔɔkɨn. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />I suyuu naa sɔrɔyi ɓɛɛ, i ntari si naa zɨngãyi ntari. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Shɔ kukiyi nɔɔsisɨn a viwɔ au tasi naa fãrã lasaka a shɔ kuki a nɔsisɨn, i yee au shɛ ai nakosẽri si naa yee gbẽnteng waanɛ i ɓɛɛ, ai ɗɔɔ laɓuti gɔ̃nɛ yɛnɛ nya sɨɨ. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />I dɛ ɗɔn i tashɔ naa neng tayɛ, jo ai dɛukɔ i kpaa kakarɛ i ntari shɔ nɔrɔ shɛllɛ maani awuni. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />I kpati au sãyiyɛ aɗɔn, shɔgbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ jashonɛ au sã too gbikiri-gbikiri yɛ. U nii a nya Ibiraniyawa nɛ Abadɔn; u nii a nya Heliniyawa nɛ Apoliyɔn (ukɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ, (&lt;&lt;Shɔ vilɛsinɛ&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Yukɔnɛ au ɗekɨn yɛ tɛɛtɛ; a knti vim kɛ yukɔnɛ ziti i yɛ arɛ.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa shɔ mangbete geeu gãnti rɛ. N nta yeenya ɗɔshɛnɛ a kawanɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a laazã tarimɛɛ au ɗɔshinɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Yeenyau geli Ɗajashonɛlapa shɔ mangbete nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ yaa Ɗajashonɛlapa nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi naatɔ shɔgbete shɔ mayi a ɓooti pɛ̃niba Yufiretis!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Shɔ yaa Ɗajashonɛlapa nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi naarɛ; gbete shɔ pɔ̃iyɛ aru ɗaam, aru leem, aru shɛllɛm, a saa mkɔ, i mabiirɛ aru i nyo shɔzɛ kn gbete atette taati a ɓusɨng shɔzɛyi kpai. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Shɔ gelin nɛ sɔja gbete ayuu gbɛntɛn sɨn nɛi si miliyon laa kopi. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ang vitasinɛ n zɛ gbɛntɛnyi ai shɔ genɛniː I ɗɔshinɛ a fãrã lasa e nɔsisɨn nweri naa yaa, larki naa sappaya, miiroo naa mii ãnkɔ̃ɔ̃, gbɛntɛnwi yuu si naa zɨngãyi yuu, zɨnri, yaa a zɔ̃pɔ̃ni shɛ ai nya. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Zɨnri, yaa a viu shɔ ɓaanɛ sulfo gbete shɛ gbɛntɛnwi nyakɔ shɔzɛ kɨn gbete atete taati shɔ nyoyi jo a ukɔ. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Aru gbɛntɛnwi kaka si jo a nyakɔ wɔsɔ̃n i dɛ̀yi; i dɛ̀yi yuu siɗɔn naa sɔɔyi, i pɛlivishonɛ jo a ukɔ i lɛsi shɔrɛ. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Gãsi shɔzɛyi a shɔ ji nyoki ɓa a nyaba yukɔnɛmkɔ ɓa, i jo kɔsi sisɨn ɓa i yaa vigbete i pɛli ai naayɛni ɓa. I jo yaa rãmayi bassinɛ ɓa, i jo yaa jaɗa a shɔ pɛli tarimɛɛ, a siliva, a vigbete shɔ maa a tarimɛɛ, tari, a laa bassinɛ ɓa, ayi nɔɔ zɛ vi ɓayɛ, i nta ruu ɓa, i raɓa. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />I ji kɔsi sisɨn ɓa i yaa shɔ nyɔkinɛrɛ ɓa, i ji yaa gãnki pɛlinɛ ɓa, roonɛ a so ko vɔshɔ gbete ɓayi ɓɛɛ ɓa, a viɓɔlinɛ i ji yaa ɓa.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">ƊajashonɛLapa a labeenɛ Linɛ Fɛ̃ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa pɛ̃niba u ɗɔɔ nɔnɛ a kolapa. U si a sabu, tagãnɗa au ɗɔ yuuni; u nɔkɨn si naa ɗaa, u dɔɔ si naa yaa ɗɛɛti. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />U labeenɛ lini fɛ̃ɛ ɓɛlinɛ si au naani. Pɔ̃u dɔɔ nakɨn a wapo, u dɔɔ nagãng si a tipi, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />a ɓaanya a gãgãni naa zɨngan layɛ. A knti gbete ɓaanyatɛ, see jalɛ manziiwi i kasinyarɛ. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Naa i nwanyatɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti nam, sin kɛ beenɛtɔ. Ama n nta yeenya a kolapa nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɓusi vigbete jalɛ manziiwi i shayɛtɔ, mɔkɔ beenɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa gbete n zɛuyɛ au shi a yuu wapo a tipi ɗeu nakɨn a lapa <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />a teerɛ a Ɗalapa nii, shɔgbete au ɔ̃ dangdang yɛ, shɔgbete au shishɛ kolapa, kotipi, a wapo, a vigbete au ɓuzɨnyɛni. Ɗajashonɛlapau shanɛ,&gt;&gt; Jang ɓaanɛ tɔkɨn ɓa! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ama aɗagbete Ɗajashonɛlapa manzii kɛ geeu gãntiyɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ yisiikɛ u viɓusinɛ nya, nagbete geli u jawɛrɛ janyagadiyi yɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya au nwanya si a nkɔni a kolapayɛ, nwanya sɔ̃n a nkɔni, u ɗɔ shanɛ nɛ,&gt;&gt;Yɛnɛ a tɛ labeenɛ linɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃u gbete a Ɗajashonɛlapa naa au shi a wapo a tipiniyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />N yɛrɛ n geli Ɗajashonɛlaparɛ n-tɔ u ang labeenɛ linɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃ nɛ. A gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;Tɛnɛ a sharɛ; yɛ ɔ̃ gbari aa yɛtini, ama aa nya yɛ shɔ̃ti naa wara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />N tɛ labeenɛ linɛ fɛ̃ɛ̃ rɛ au naa n sharɛ, n ntarɛ shɔ̃ti naa wara ang nyani. Ama a knti gbete n mɛtɛ, rikɛ gbari ang yɛtini. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ pasin gelinɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubiitɔ a tipi tottot, a shɛ̃ɛ̃ shɔzɛyi, a nyakooyi, a kpatiyini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ Shinɛkɨnti Ziti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ ang labaa au tasinɛ naa labaa vitesinɛ a shɔ gelinɛ, &lt;&lt;Yɛnɛ a tesi wɛrɛ Ɗa a laazãni, a ga wɔsɔn shɔ Ɗa basinɛyi a ɓuzɨnni. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ama mɔkɔ tesi ka ɓilinɛ, aruviya shɔ ã shɔgbeteyi gɨn Ɗa ɓayɛ tɛttɔ, shɔgbeteyi i yɛ tasi koomo Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔm raa shɛllɛ laa ziti au jaa zitiyɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />N yɛn shong shɔshinɛkɨnti zitiyi ai yɛ tosi fãrã sisɨn hɨmri e sisɨn hɨmri tasinɛ, i yɛ nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii lee 1,260.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Shɔshinɛkɨnti zitiwi ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ laa zaitu zitiyi a laa ziti gbete pitila shi aɗɔm a Uɓeyelapa shɔ kotipimi ɗekɨn. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Naa shɔ wɔɔ kɛ tɔnɛn lɛsiyitɔ, yaa shɛ ai nya a shaayi shɔnɔpɔ̃yirɛ; jo nyabankɔ shɔgbete i kasiyi nyokinɛ shɔ nyokiyirɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />I kaka ɗɔn i shiri mii kolapa u a ɓa aɗagbete ikɛ nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubiinɛyɛ. I kaka sɔ̃n a yuu mii lunɛni, i risi miiyi i ɔ̃ kpaa; i kaka sɔ̃n ɗɔn i wiri ko-pi vigbetepiya au yɛ lɛsi kotipi aɗagbete i kasiyɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Naa i yisi shɔ Ɗa nyaruubii nwarinɛ tɛ, viɓili pɛ̃niɓa au shɛ a too gbikiri-gbikiri yɛ wabarɛ a yini. ɗashaariurɛ nyoyirɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Shɔ yɛ yɔyi vɔrɔ a nyaba lanɛ koomo pɛ̃niba, a ɗɔgbete iɓeyelapa shɔ ɓaunalaa. Koomou nii tasinɛ nɛ Sodum ko Masar. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kɛɗɔn alee taati au ɗiti shɔ a kotipi kpai, a shɛ̃ɛ̃ shɔzɛyi, laduru, a nyakooni tottot, i yɛ biliyi bi vɔrɔu shɔyɛ zãri gbãnɛtɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Shɔ kotipiyi yɛ nta yɛti purutɔ aru shɔ zitimiyi vɔnɛni. I yɛ musi yuutɔ i shaarɛ a ɓoonɛni i ãli zɔvirɛ, aru janyagadi zitimiyi ai n ti yukɔnɛ a kotipi kpai miyi yuuni. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ama a knti lee taati a ɗiti ɔ̃kinɛ au ã suru yɛ shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii toyi teterɛ, i yulaparɛ i shi a dɔɔ; shɔgbeteyi zɛyiyɛ kpai seti pɛliyitɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Kɛɗɔn janyagadiyi ziti i nta yeenya a kakani shɛ a kolapa shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ gẽ lapam!&gt;&gt;Kɛɗɔn i shɔnɔpɔ̃yi aɗɔ zɛnɛ i gẽ kolaparɛ a yɛti sabu. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />A ɗawukɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti tipi ɓɛ pɛ̃niba, tali koomou lɛsirɛ, shɔzɛ laa maani kopi ɓa manzii tipi ɓɛnɛu nyɔyi vɔrɔrɛ. Shɔ gãsiyi ntaseti ai bɛli Ɗalapa au kolaparɛ.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Raaɓoonɛ au pɛsiyɛ tɛɛtɛ, ama yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa raɓoonɛ shɔ taati yɛ atɔǃ<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gãnti e Manzii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Kɛɗɔn ɗajashonɛlapa e manzii geeu ganti rɛ, shɔ nta yeenyayi a kakani a kolapa nɛ,&lt;&lt;Kaka kotipi sãnɛ dɔdɔrim pɛ Uɓeyelapa au Kirisi ɓɛɛ. Yɛ roo kpati dangdangǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Kɛɗɔn shɔpɛ̃ni mbati au jaa nɛ̃ɛti gbeteyi ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ ai lakpati i wẽsirɛ Ɗalapa ɗekɨn i zu nɔkɨn tipi i basiurɛ. <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />I shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt; U dɔ̃ri Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛtɛ, shɔ gbete dɔdɔrim, mɔkaa si jo tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">U dɔ̃raatɛ aruviya a tɛ a kaka pɛ̃nibatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">a gaa kpati roonɛtɛ!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Shɔ gbeteyi ji zɛa ɓayɛ i sisɨn lɛsitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ama a ɗaa sisɨn lɛsinɛ pɛlitɛ, ɗaa gbete shɔ yeeruu ayuu shɔ gbeteyi vɔlitɛyɛ i yuu pɛlitɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ɗaa gbete shɔ ãa jawɛrɛyi janyagadiyi kaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">aa shɔbiiyini piti pɛlitɛ, shɔ gbeteyi nta a setiyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">shɔ pɛ̃niba a wujaayini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ɗaa pɛlitɛ a shɔ nyoki shɔ gbeteyi i lɛsi kotipiyɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ ɓeli wɛrɛ Ɗa rɛ a kolapa, shɔ zɛ kotoro ruumanɛrɛ a ɓuzɨn wɛrɛ Ɗauni. Kɛɗɔn ɗɔkɔlirɛ, a vikalinɛni a jɛlɛ nyakaanɛ, tipi ɓɛnɛ wɔsɔ̃n tala pɛ̃niba-pɛ̃niba.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Suwɔ a Sɔɔ pɛ̃niba au shɛshi yaa au nya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ viseti pɛ̃niba shɛ a kunyasi, n zɛ suwɔ u fãrã tosinɛ si ɗaa, u dɔɔ si ayuu shɛlɛ, tosi wayu kpati gbete u sɛ a biini kopi atu ziti au yuu. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />U jaa si a yɛti, sɨnrɛ u ɗɔ kɔnɛ ntanɛ aruviya u si nyaba jaa yeenɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Kɛɗɔn viseti wɔ shɛrɛ a kunyasi, si pɛ sɔɔ nweri au shɛshi yaayɛ pɛ̃niba, u yuu manzii u lagee kopi li wayu kpati manzii ko-pi au yuu shopiyani <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />U ɗe gɔ̃ sɛ kn gbete atette taati a kunyasi ko- pi shɔpiyani anɛ tipi a kotipi. U ɗɔ shinɛ a suu ɗekɨn, aru kɛ yeejaanɛ tɛ̃ɛ̃ti nam u shaarɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Kɛɗɔn yee javɔshɔrɛ, au yɛ roo kpati u sã shɔ a koo kpai a nyaba yukɔnɛ. ama shɔ raa jaau rɛ shɔ n-tiu Ɗalapa ɗɔbii au lakpatiuni. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Suu yuurɛ yɛnɛ gɔggɔɔ, ɗɔ gbete Ɗalapa pɛlirɛ nɛu ɔ̃ ɗɔni, ɗɔgbete shɔ kɔuyɛ yɛnɛ lee laa maani ɓa kopi atu ziti au jaa laa taati (1,260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Kɛɗɔn sɨn ranaa a kolapa. Mikel au ɗajashonɛlapayi waabarɛ a sɔɔ pɛ̃nibauni, sɔɔ pɛ̃nibau au jashonɛlapayini i waaba sɔ̃njirɛ a yini. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ama bau tɛɛ sɔɔu kakarɛ, u au jashonɛlapayini shɔ ji yau tɔɓa nɛ ɔ̃rɛ a kolapani ɓa. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ loki kpɛnti sɔɔ pɛ̃nibaurɛ, kɛ sɔɔ tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃m shɔ ɓaunɛ kpati rãmã ko japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃, au ɗaki shɔ kotipitɛ kpaimi, shɔ lokiutɛ a kotipi au jashonɛni kpai.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya pɛ̃niɓa a kolapa kɛ shanɛ nɛ&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa shɔraanɛ atɛ! Dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa tasiu kakatɛ nɛn kpati! Dɔdɔrim u Kirisi tasiu kakatɛ! Aruviya shɔ gbeteu shi au Ɗalapa ɗekɨn wuli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ ko-pi leepiya zɨmba a niti ni shɔ yikiutɛ a kolapani. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ɗashaariyirɛ au yuuni, a nyaba Ɗa jamɛɛrɛ kpaa nteenɛ, a nyaba ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete i nwari shɔyɛni, i ji ntaseti vɔnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Aru nankɔ ɔ nta sisɨn purunɛ, ɔ kolapa, shɔgbete ɔ ɔ̃ a ɗɔnimi! Ama ɔ sisɨn yɛ vɨmtɔ fɛ̃ɛm kotipi a waponi! Aruviya japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ nɔtɛ awɔ ɗɔbii a kotipi, u nɔɔ a yɛtini fɛ̃ɛm aruviya zɛtɛttɔ u ɗaa yaatɛ sekaa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Naa sɔɔ pɛnibau zɛtɛ nɛ shɔ lokintɛ a kotipi, kɛɗɔn gaa kɛ su au yee javɔshɔu yikini. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Shɔ ã suu ɓagenwerɛ nakosẽri pɛ̃niba ziti, aru u durɛ yɛnɛ u ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a gɔggɔɔ, a ɗɔgbete shɔyɛ kɔuyɛ saa taati a ɗiti, nɔgbete sɔɔu yɛ lɛsiu ɓayɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Kɛɗɔn sɔɔ pɛnibau shɛshi mii au nya naa mii ɓooti a suu knti aruviya nɛ siutɔ. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ama tipi raa suu rɛ; tipi ɓeli nyarɛ a mɛ mii au shɛ a sɔɔu nyarɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Sɔɔu lɛsi sisɨn a suuni fɛ̃ɛm, a yurɛ nɛn waaba a suu laduru gãsini, shɔ gbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛyɛ kpai, ai sisɨn ãnɛ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn e Yesɔ ɓeliyɛ. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Kɛɗɔn sɔɔ pɛ̃nibau shikɛ a seseli a nya wapo.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Viɓili Ziti Ai Shɛ a Wapo Yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ viɓili kɛ shɛnɛ a wapo. U lagee kopi, u yuu manzii; ko-pi lagee shɔpiya wayu kpati aɗɔn kopi, ko-pi yuu shɔpiya nii a ɗɔnni au n ti Ɗalapa bassinɛ ɓayɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Viɓiliu shɛ zɔ a gbẽẽ, u dɔɔ pɛ̃niba shɛ̃nti aɗɔn u nya naa zinggang nya. Sɔɔ pɛ̃niba ã viɓiliu u kakarɛ, au lakpatini, wɔ̃sɔn u kaka kiririni. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Atette viɓiliu yuu gbete, naa shɔ waatɔ au yɛ n-tiu vɔnɛyɛ, ama ɗɔu gatitɛ. Viɓili ã shɔzɛ kpai vibiizanɛ i gɨukɛ a knti. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Kopiya bassi sɔɔ pɛ̃nibautɔ aru ã viɓiliu u kakatɛ, i bassi viɓili sɔ̃njɔ, i shanɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Pi shɛ zɔ a viɓilini piya? Pi zɛnɔ bawaanɛ awuni piya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Viɓiliu shɔ yaaurɛ nɛu nwanya yuu bassinɛ au n ti Ɗalapa bassinɛ ɓa, shɔ yaaurɛ u tasi u kaka yɛnɛ shɛlɛ laaziti atu ziti. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Kɛɗɔn gaa Ɗalapa nii lɛsinɛrɛ, a ɗɔgbete ɔ̃ a ɗɔnniyɛ, a shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃ a kolapayɛni kpai. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Shɔ yaaurɛ u waaba a Ɗalapa shɔbiini ɗausharirɛ ai yuu, shɔ ãu kakarɛ u sã ko-pi laduru shɔpiya, tipi, nyakoyini a shɛ̃ɛ̃shɔzɛyini. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Shɔzɛ gbeteyi ɔ̃ a kotipi kpai i bassi viɓiliutɔ, see shɔ gbete kotipi ɓɛɛ shɛnɛ shɔ bee nii tɛttɔ a labeeni suruni i pɛ Ɗa jamɛrɛ̃ ɓɛɛ au shɔ nyoyɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ wesho pɛ, shɔu sho ntanɛ aɗɔn u ntarɛ, <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Shɔ gbete Ɗalapa kɛ lɔnɛ nɛu to jahm, yɛ to jahmtɔ; shɔ gbete Ɗalapa kɛ lɔnɛ nɛ shɔu nyou a nyaba zali, yɛ vɔ jo a nyaba zali, vim kã Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi ɔ̃ shɔ sisɨnmɛnɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ viɓili wɔrɛ, au shɛ a tipi, u lageeyi ziti naa jamɛrɛ̃ lageeyi, u nyanwanɛ naa sɔɔ pɛ̃niba nya. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Shovi-shonɛ a kaka pɛ̃niba gbete viɓili ɗekɨn sho a wuniyɛ a viɓiliu ɗekɨn. A pɔ̃rɛ kotipi a vi gbeteyi ɔ̃ a ɗɔnni kpai i bassi viɓili ɗekɨn, kɛ shɔ gbete u nɔrɔ gati tɛttɔyɛ. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Viɓili au pɛsim pɛli vibiizaanɛyi pɛ̃niba; pɔ̃rɛ yaa nɔ a kolapa a ntee a tipi shɔ zɛ piti. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Aru vibiizaanɛ gbete shɔ yaaurɛ nɛu pɛli a viɓili ɗekɨn u ɗɔbii, kpaa kakarɛ a ɗaki shɔ gbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a kotipi kpai. Viɓiliu geliyi nɛ i maa jasuru aru i bassi viɓili au shɔ ntariu nɔrɔ a zali ama u doo ɗɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a suruni. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Shɔ yaa viɓili pɛsinɛurɛ kpaa kaka gbete ã jasuru viɓili ɗekɨn ɔ̃kinɛ sururɛ, nɔgbete jasuru u nwanya, u nyoki shɔgbeteyi bɛ̃ɛ̃ u bassinɛ kpai. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Viɓiliu pɔ̃si kopiya vibeenɛ a nakɨn ko i nɔkɨn, wujaa a pɛ̃nibani, shɔvinaa a shɔraani, foo a jalaajaani <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />pɛli nankɔ aru shɔwɔ u zɛnɔ viwɔ woonɛ ɓa ko mɛlinɛ ɓa see shɔu nɔmba aɗɔn, kɛ viɓiliu nii, ko nɔmba gbete shi ayuu viɓili niiyɛ.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Vim kã sẽrẽ. Shɔgbeteu ruu kpẽnɛ aɗɔn yɛ shɛshi dɔɔ ruu nɔmba viɓilintɔ, aru nɔmbau shi pɛ ayuu shɔwɔ nii, u nɔmba ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Jamɛrɛ̃ a Shɔzɛ 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Kɛɗɔn n kɨnnɔɔ rɛ n zɛ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ a ɗɔshinɛ a kɔpɔ siyona, awuni si shɔzɛ laa maani ɓa kopi au jaa laaziti atu nɛ̃ɛ̃ti(144,000) shɔ gbeteyi u nii au ɓeye nii ni shɔ bee tɛttɔ ai nokɨn. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />N nta yeenya wɔ shɛrɛ a kolapa naa mii ɗɔ ntɛɛnɛ, naa jalɛ ɗɔ lanɛ a gãgãni. Kaa nya naa viwaanɛ gbete shɔ viwaanɛ i waayi hɨmtaa yɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Shɔzɛ (144,000) i shi a ɗekɨn lakpati, a vishɛshinɛ suru nɛ̃ɛ̃ti, a shɔpɛ̃niyi ɗekɨn; i ɗɔ soo sɔɔ ntoonɛ, au ji ikɔyi zɛunɔɔ ntoonɛ ji sheeli, atette shɛ̃ɛ̃shɔzɛyi kpai Ɗalapa raa ji ikɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Vɔshɔ ai pɔ̃ yuu wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ i ji roonɛ ɓa a soni ɓa; i pɛ nyarãyi, i gɨn jamɛ̃rɛ̃m yɛnɛ ɗɔgbete yɛ-yɛ kpai. I kɔyi shɔgbete shɔ raayi atette shɛ̃ɛ̃shɔzɛ yɛ, ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ shɔ ɗekɨn a shɔ ã Ɗalapa a jamɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ ni. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Shɔ ji nta nyayeenɛ ɓa ai nyani shãni ɓa, i ɓa shɔruuvini ɓa.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗajashonɛlapa taati i Ruu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔ u ɗɔ shàánɛ a konyasi feefee, a ruu tɔ̃vɨn au sɔ̃nya ɓayɛ aru u geli shɔ kotipi, ko-pi shɛ̃ɛ̃shɔzɛyi shɔpiya, laduru, nyakoo, a tipini. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Ɗenya a kakani a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɔ nta Ɗalapa setitɔ, ɔ bassiutɔ, Ɔ bɛliu banɛtɔ! Aruviya ɗaa pɛlitɛ au yɛ yeeruu a shɔ yuu pitini. Ɔ bassiutɔ shɔ gbete shɛshi kolapa, kotipi, wapo, a ɗɔgbete mii ɓu ɗɔnyɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ɗajashonɛlapa au pɛsiyɛ gɨn shɔ ɗekɨn, a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nwesitɛǃ Babila pɛ̃niɓa nwesitɛǃ Shɔgbeteu pɔ̃ shɔ piti a koo shɔ ɓɔɔ mii inabi a shɔ wirirɛ a nyaba kpantang pɛlinɛ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e taati gɨn shɔ ɗekɨn zitiwirɛ, u ɗɔ shanɛ a kakani nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbeteyi kɛ bassi viɓilin nɛ au jasuru ni, ayi tɛu nɔmba ai nɔkɨn, ko ai naa, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />ikɔ yɛ ɓoo mii inabi Ɗalapa sisɨng lɛsinɛrɛ ai yuu, ukɔ tẽẽrɛ loti au yɛti waa sisɨn lɛsinɛǃ A ɗajashonɛlapa wɔsɔ wɔsɔ a jamɛrɛ̃ ɗekɨn Ɗalapa yɛ tasiyi raatɔ fɛ̃ɛm a yaa, a kolo yaa. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Zɨnri yaa i raaɓoonɛu yɛ-yɛ ɗekɨn dangdang. Shɔgbeteyi bassi viɓiliu au jasuru ni shɔ yɛ ntayi raa ɓa ko a niti ko a zɨbani kpai, a shɔgbeteyi tɛyi nɔmba ayi niiyɛ ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Vim kã shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi i sisɨnmɛɛnɛ, shɔgbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa nya-ãsinɛtɔ, ai ã sisɨntɔ a Yɛsɔ kirisi biini.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya a kolapa shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Bee vimnɛ: Ɗa u tasi shɔ gbeteyi vɔ au yuu nyaba vishonɛ pɛlinɛ susãri abiini dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Ɗa suru kasinyanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nankɔ nizɛ, i yɛ susutɔ ai raaɓoonɛ fɛ̃ɛm ni, aruviya ɗɔnwanɛ vishonɛ gbeteyi pɛliyɛ a ɗɔgbete gɨnyɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Ruuyeenɛ a Kotipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Kɛɗɔn n kɨnnɔɔ n zɛ sabu puru, n zɛ viwɔ ɔ̃tɛ ayuu sabuuni naa shɔzɛ, u salabu kpati a yuuni e tarimɛɛ, a gesini pii-pipi au naa. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔ shɛrɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, a ɓaa shɔgbeteu aɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ atette sabu nya a kakani shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɛshaa gesinɛ a gaa viyeenɛ aru ɗaa viyeenɛ pɛlitɛ, visha kotipi zɔ̃ tɛttɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Kɛɗɔn shɔgbeteu ɔ̃ a sabuu lokiu gesirɛ a kotipi. Shɔ yee visha kotipirɛ.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔrɛ shɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa a kolapa, u gesi sɔ̃njo ɗɔn pii-pipi.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔsɔ̃n ɗɔn, gbeteu pɛli vishonɛ aka yaa shɛ a laazã. A ɓaa Ɗajashonɛlapa gbeteu a gesi ni a naa nya a kakani shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Gɨn a gesinɛ a yee nɔlaa inabi kotipirɛ, aru u jaa zɔ̃ tɛttɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapau lokiu gesirɛ ayuu kotipi, a yee nɔlaa inabiirɛ a laa, a lokiyirɛ aɗɔgbete shɔ kamii inabii au lɛsi Ɗalapa sisɨn yɛ. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Shɔ nali inabiurɛ a koomo ɓili, kpaa shɛkirɛ a ɗɔuni au shɔkɛ teesinɛ a laa viteesinɛ, u kpɛlɛ yɛ ɔ̃tɔ laa maani ɓa kopi atu mangbete (1600) ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kilomita laamaani ɓa taati, u jangba yɛ ɔ̃ naa gbɛntɛn dɔɔ maangbete.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ɗajashonɛlapa Gbete i N ti vɔrɔ Nakunɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ viyukɔnɛ wɔ a konyasi, pɛ̃niba, vibiizaanɛ, Ɗajashonɛlapayi manzii a yukɔnɛ manzii au kunayɛ, shɔgbete ai kunayɛ, aru ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ vigbeteyi tasi Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ dangdang.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ viwɔ au naa wapo zɛlivini au rãa a yaa, ang zɛ wɔsɔ̃n shɔgbeteyi ɗashaariyi a viɓili au jasuru yuuni, wɔsɔ̃n shɔgbeteyi nii shikɛ ayuu nɔmbayɛ, i ɗɔshinɛ a wapo zɛlivini, i sã hmtaa gbete Ɗalapa ãiyɛ, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />i ɗɔ Musa soo tɔ̃nɛ, Ɗalapa jashonɛ a jamɛrɛ̃ɛ̃ sooniː i shanɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">vigbete a pɛliyɛ aa vinɔlusinɛni i pɛ̃niba fɛ̃ɛmǃ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Kpati au sã shɔ tipiyi yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">a nyaba pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, pɛ nizɛ tɔkɨnǃ<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Piyɛ ntaa seti ɓa piya Uɓeyelapa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kɛpiyɛ bɛ̃ɛ̃ a bassinɛ piya?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">mɔkaa ɔ̃rɛ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ sheeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">shɔzɛ koo piti i yɛ aa ɗɔbiitɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">i bassaa rɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">aruviya a vipɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn kopiya zɛtɛttɔ piti kpai.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />A kɨnti vim n zɛrɛ wɛrɛ Ɗa a kolapa ɓelitɛ a tali viɓusinɛ a ɗɔnni. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlpayi maazii ai yukɔnɛ manzii ai ɗɔbii i shɛrɛ a ɓuzɨn wɛrɛ Ɗauni, i tosi fãrã lili ɓolo-ɓolo, ai ma tarimɛɛ ai ɗɔ nɔsisɨnni. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Kɛɗɔn vi gbete atette visuru a Ɗalapa shɛshiyɛ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti ã Ɗajashonɛlapa manziiyi pii tarimɛ̃ɛ̃ au yitɛttɔ lot a Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛni, au ɔ̃ a suru ni dangdang yɛ. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Kɛɗɔn zɨnri au shɛ aɗɔ gbete shɔ bassi Ɗalapa yɛ au kakani raa wɛrɛ Ɗau kpai. Shɔwɔ ji zɛnɔɔ wɛrɛ Ɗau tonɛ ɓa, see Ɗajashonɛlapayi ai n ti yukɔnɛ manzii yisinya pɛtɔ.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Pii Manzii Shɔ Ɗalapa Sisɨn Lɛsinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya a kakani au shɛ a wɛrɛ Ɗa, nwanyau geli Ɗajashonɛlapa manziiwi nɛ: &lt;&lt;Ɔ yɛnɛ ɔ tẽri shɔ pii manzii e Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ a kotipi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ɗajashonɛlapa ɗekɨn yɛrɛ a tẽe vigbete au pii a kotipi, kɛɗɔn nɔrɔ vɔrɔ au kɔnɛ aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm shɛrɛ a shɔgbeteyi nɔmba viɓiliu ai biini, a shɔ gbeteyi basiu jasuru yɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ɗajashonɛlapa au pɛsiyɛ tẽeu vigbete au piirɛ a wapo. mii wapou rirɛ a ɔ̃ naa shɔgbete vɔ tɛttɔ kpaa, visuru koshɔpiya au a yɛti mii wapouni kpai i vɔlirɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e taatiu tẽeu vigbete au piirɛ jo a ɓooti a ɗɔgbete mii ɓuɗɔnyɛ, see i rii kpaarɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />N nta Ɗajashonɛlapa au sã mii yɛ shanɛ, &lt;&lt; A ruuyeenɛ tɔ̃vɨn, apɛ shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, mɔkɔ apɛ a shɔgbete asi! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Aruviya shɔmiyi nyɔki shɔtɔ̃vɨngtɛ a Ɗajashonɛlapayini, dɔdɔrim a ãi kpaatɛ nɛi ɓootɔ, raaɓoonɛm pɛ vigbete tɔ̃rɛ shɔu ãyɛkɔǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya shɛ a laazã shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa shɔgbete viteu kaka ɓayɛ! Nankɔ a ruuyeenɛ pɛ nizɛ, pɛ tɔ̃vɨnǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e nɛɛti tẽẽ vigbete au pii a ɗaa, a shɔ yaarɛ nɛu too shɔ au nwanɛni. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Ɗɔ nwanɛ too shɔwirɛ, ai gaa ruu shalinɛ au n ti Ɗalapa bassinɛ ɓayɛ, shɔgbeteu kaka yukɔnɛm ɗɔn. Ama i ji kɔsi sisɨn ɓa i yaayi ruuvini pɛlinɛ i bɛliu banɛrɛ ɓa.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e maani tẽeu vigbete au piirɛ a viɓiliu lakpati, ɗɔkɨnri raa viɓiliu ɗɔgbete roo kpati kpai, shɔ shaa ntarirɛ shẽtẽ-shẽtẽ aru raa gbeteyi ɓooyɛ <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />I lɛsi Ɗalapa gbete au kolapa nii fɛ̃ɛm aru raaɓoonɛ ai nɔɔrɔɔni, ama i ji yaai nyaba vikɔ̃likinɛ gbete i pɛliyɛ ɓa.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ɗajashonɛlapa e mangbete tẽeu vigbete au piirɛ a ɓooti pɛ̃niba Yuferetis, kɛɗɔn ɓootiu ɔ̃rirɛ, aruviya shɔu yaasi kpati au yɛ shɛ a gɨnri nyaba. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ suru taati ai ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa gbeteyi shɛ vɔɔyi, gbete shɛ sɔɔ yaa shɛshinɛ nya, wɔ shɛ a viɓili nya, wɔsɔ̃n a janyagadi nyayeelinɛ nya. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />I pɛ suru kɔ̃linɛ gbeteyi pɛli vibiizaanɛyɛ, i shɛrɛ yɛnɛ kpati kotipi taatimiyi ɗɔbii, i toliyi nya ɗɔgbete aru sɨntaanɛ a lee pɛ̃nibam a Ɗalapa shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛ.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Kirisi shanɛ, ɔ kpaasisɨntɔ, &lt;&lt;N yɛn a naa ɓoo! Ɗalapa u tasi shɔgbeteu ɔ̃ a nɔkãkãri susãri abiini, shɔgbeteyi kɔyi fãrã, aruviya yɛ raarɛ a biwaati u nta yusẽ a shɔ ɗekɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Kɛɗɔn suru kɔ̃linɛwi i toli kpatiyi ɗɔgbete, aɗɔ wɔ shɔ ɓa a nya Hiburu nɛ Amagido.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa e manzii tẽeu vigbete au piirɛ a konyasi. Kɛɗɔn yeenya wɔ shɛ a lakpati ɓusɨng wɛrɛ Ɗa a kakani shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔ yisinyatɛǃ &gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ zɛ ɗɔ kɔlinɛ, a vikalinɛ, a jalɛ ɓɛnɛ, wɔsɔ̃n tipi zɨtinɛ pɛ̃niba shɔzɛ ɓɛɛ shɛshinɛyɛ a shɔ ji pɛli ɓa shãni ɓa; shompɛ tipi ɓɛnɛ pɛ̃niba au tɛɛ wɔyitɔ kpai. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Komoo pɛ̃nibam vɔsirɛ taati, komoo pɛ̃nibau a shɔ kotipiyini kpai i zilirɛ. Ɗalapa kpaa sisɨnrɛ ayuu Babila pɛ̃niba, a pɔ̃urɛ u ɓoo jawaa mii inabi e u sisɨn lɛsinɛ au tɛɛ kakayɛ. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Tipiu mii kɨntiyɛ nii rɛ kpai, kɔpɔyi kpai shɔ ji zɛyi tɔɓa. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Tala pɛ̃niba, kpetinɛ a ɗɔnni mɛnɛ lazɔrɔ tɛ̃yɛ gbete, i zɨlirɛ a konyasi a shɔ yuu, au pɔ̃rɛ shɔ dã Ɗalapa aru raa gbete tala tasi shɔyɛ, yukɔnɛu si pɛ̃niɓa tɛɛ kaka tɔ.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Su Kpatang Pɛ̃niɓa a Viɓili Wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Kɛɗɔn gbete atette Ɗajashonɛlapa manzii ai pii manzii ɗɔn ang ɗɔbii a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Anɛ n tasaa nɔgbete shɔyɛ tasi su kpatang pɛ̃niɓam raa pɛ, ukɔ sã tipi pɛ̃niba eyi a nyabooti waanɛ miyirɛ, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />kpati kotipimiyi, i rootɛ awuni, shɔ kotipimi i wirirɛ aru i ɓoou mii inabi ruuvini kpatang ayi pɛli a wuniyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />kɛɗɔn Ɗa suru tunrɛ, a Ɗajashonɛlapa tunrɛ yɛnɛ ɗɔ gɔggɔɔ. Aɗɔwakɔ n zɛ su wɔ ɔ̃tɛ ayuu viɓili nweri wɔ, viɓiliu shɔ bee nii gbete dã Ɗalapa au biini piti; viɓiliu yuuyi manzii u lageeyi kopi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Suu hã fãrã naa miizarɛ a nweri, bariki bi a tarimɛɛ, a tari au saa yuu bang yɛ wɔsɔ̃n tari puru. Au naa sã jawaa tarimɛɛ au yiitɛttɔ lot au vizara kpãntang pɛlinɛni. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Au nɔkɨn nii beenɛ wɔyi siɗɔn au dɔɔyi si ɓusinɛ &lt;&lt;Babila pɛ̃niɓa, kpantang-yi ɓini kpai, shɔgbete lɛsi kotipiyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />N zɛ suurɛ yuuwitiutɛ aru ɓoo shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi kpaa a shɔgbeteyi shɔ nyokirɛ aru nɛyi gɨn Yesɔ nya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Naa n zɛutɛ, n bizaa fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Ɗajashonɛlapa hɨnnɛ, &lt;&lt;Bizaa aruviya? N yɛn tasaadɔɔ rubusinɛ a sum yuu a viɓili gbete au tuuyɛtɔ. Viɓili au yuu manzii a lagee kopi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Viɓilim si ɔ̃tɛttɔ a suruni ama dɔdɔrim u toɓa . Yɛ shɛ a too gbikiri-gbikiri anɛ ɗɔgbete shɔyɛ lɛsiuyɛ, shɔgbeteyi ɔ̃nɛ a kotipim a shɔ ji beeyi nii ɓa a labeenɛ a suruni ɓa aɗagbete shɔ shɛshi kotipiyɛ ni ɓa, i yɛ nta vibiizaanɛtɔ, ikɛ kɨnnɔɔ nɛ a viɓiliuni. Viɓiliu si a suru ni, dɔdɔrim u tɔɓa a suru ni ɓa, ama yɛ sɔɔ sɔ̃ntɔ.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />&lt;&lt;Vim kasirɛ nɛ shɔu ɔ̃ a sẽrẽ a vizɛnɛni. yuu manziimiyi ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ doddo manzii, gbete suu ɔ̃ au yuuni yɛ, ikɔyi sɔ̃n kpati manziimiyi. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Maani ai tetteni i nwesitɛ ama gbete wɔ u doo ɗɔn, gbete wɔ ji apɛ ɓa; naa kaanɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u roo kpatitɔ sekaa. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Viɓili au si a suru ni ama dɔdɔrim u toɓa suruni ɓa, ukɔu pɛ kpati e maantaa, shɛ pɛ atette shɔ manziimiyikɔ, u ɗɔgbete yɛ ɗɔu shɔyɛ lɛsiuyɛ.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Lagee kopi gbete a zɛyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ kpati kopi ai ji gayi kpati roonɛ pɛ ɓa, ama shɔyɛ ãyi naatɔ i ɔ̃ kpati a viɓiliuni e dɔɔɗa gbete. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Kpati kopimiyi vi au ai sisɨn gbete, i kaka ai kpati roonɛ i ãpɛ a viɓiliu nakɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />I yɛ waabatɔ a jamɛ̃rɛ̃uni; ama ɗa yɛ shaari jamɛ̃rɛ̃ɛ̃utɔ a nyazɔɔ a shɔgbete ɓayinya a lɔyiyɛ au jadɔɔ sisɨn ãnɛyini ai yuuni, aru u pɛ Uɓeyelapa i ɓeye a kpatiyi i Kpati.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa gelin sɔ̃nɛ, &lt;&lt;Miiyi gbete a zɛyɛ, a su kpantang ɔ̃ au yuuniyɛ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ tipiyi, shɔzɛyi, shɛ̃ɛ̃shɔzɛyi, wɔsɔ̃n nyakooyi. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Lagee kopi gbete a zɛyɛ a viɓilini i yɛ ɓɛ̃ɛ̃ su kpantautɔ; i yɛ raa vigbete u a wuniyɛtɔ kpai i yaau ntowaati; i yɛ shaau yɔpɔtɔ i tourɛ a yaa. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Aru Ɗalapa pɔ̃ tɛttɔ ai sisɨn nɛi pɛli vigbete ma au sisɨn, a nyaba vishonɛ a nyazɔ i ɔ̃ a sisɨn gbete i ã viɓilim i kaka gbete yɛ roo pkati anɛ ɗagbete shɔ kpaa ruu Ɗalapa zɛnɛ.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />&lt;&lt;Su gbete a zɛm ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ koomo pɛ̃niɓa au roo kpati a kpati kotipimiyi yuuyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Babila Nwesinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Akɨnti vim, n zɛ Ɗajasonɛlapa wɔ kɛ nɔnɛ a kolapa, u kaka aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, u bassinɛ kɔli ɗɔsẽsẽ a kotipi kpai. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Ɓanya a gãgãni a shanɛː &lt;&lt;Suu nwesitɛǃ Babila pɛ̃niɓa nwesitɛǃ Dɔdɔrim ɔ̃kɛtɛ rãma a suru kɔ̃linɛyi ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ; a zɔng janɔyi kopishɔpiya au ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓa i ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Aru shɔtipiyi kpai i masiu bitɛjo a kpantang au pɛliyɛni. Kpati kotipimiyi i pɛli kpantang tɛ awuni, Jalumoo kotipiyi i vinaa batɛ a nyaba gbɔgbɔ ntanɛ au bi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Kɛɗɔn n nta yeenya wɔsɔ̃n a kolapa shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt; Ɔ shɛnɛ, ɔ n shɔbiiyi! Ɔ shɛnɛ au ɗɔbiini!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Aruviya ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ au tete ruuvini gbete pɛliyɛni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ au ɓuzɨn raaɓoonɛni!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Aruviya u ruuvini batɛ bang yɛnɛ kolapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">Ɗalapa kpasisɨntɛ au vilanɛ au pɛliyɛni.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Ɔ pɛliu vijo zali nagbete pɛlɔɔyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Vigbete pɛlɔɔ yɛ kpai ɔ kɔsiunɔ ɓa ziti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">viɓoonɛ au pɛlɔɔ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ɔ yisiu waa ziti u kaka u ɔ̃ zali au ɓɛɛ au pɛlɔɔyɛni.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ɔ tasiu raatɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ pɔ̃u sisɨn hɨmri ntanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">nagbete basiu yuuyɛ aru gbete ãu yuu tɔ̃vɨn ntanɛ a jazɛbii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Aru basiu yuu shali au sisɨn nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;N pɛ sukpaa ang lakpatiǃ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">N ɓa suvɔ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">n yɛn nta sisɨn hɨmri jo ɓaǃ &gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Arumkɔ, lee wɔ ɗɔn yukɔnɛ yɛ pɛliutɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vɔrɔ, ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn hɨmri, a vanwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">shɔyɛ tou a yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">aruviya Ɗalapa Uɓeyelapa gbete yeeruu au yuu, vitɛu kaka ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Kpati kotipi gbete i pɛli kpantang a gbɔgbɔ jazɛbii a wuniyɛ, i yɛ sɨntɔ i nteemiri au yuu, aɗagbete i kɛ zɛ zɨnri yaa gbete shauyɛnɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />I yɛ shi ɗɔkpɛlɛ, aruviya i ntaseti ikɔyi ɓooraanɛ awuni a nyazɔɔ, i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yukɔnɛ a ɗɔnǃ Yukɔnɛ pɛ̃niɓa aɗɔn! Mɔkaa ɔ̃rɛ koomo pɛniba Babilaǃ Atette dɔɔɗa gbete shɔ tasaaraatɛǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Jalumoo kotipiyi i ɗɔgbete i sɨriuyɛ, i ɗɔ sisɨn hɨmri ntanɛ au yuu, aruviya shɔgbete wooyi vimɛlinɛ tɔkɨn ɓa; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />shɔgbete au yɛ wooyi tarimɛɛ toɓa, siliva, tari gbeteu saa yuuni, a tari puru; i fãrã tolinɛ, fãrã miizarɛ, fãrã saayi, fãrã mii nweriyɛ, laa sũrũ-sũrũ tot-tot, zɔ̃ng vigbete shɔ tɔ̃ri a Bɔ lagee a ntari, a viu shɔ tɔ̃ri a laa gbeteu saa yuuni, vitarimɛɛ puru, lasaka, a tari tɔ̃vɨn; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Laa a shɔ ntee sɔ̃nki shɔ ɓaanɛ sinamo, naa gãsaayi, laa sũrũ-sũrũ zɨnri ɓunɛ, nɔɔ au saa yuuni shɔ ɓaanɛ mur, a nɔɔ sũrũ-sũrũ; mii inabi a nɔɔ, zɨn a nɔwisi, napu a mɛ̃rɛ̃, gbɛntɛnyi a laɓuti, fooyi a shɔzɛ suruyini. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Jalumooyi geli suu nɛ, &lt;&lt;Vitɔ̃vɨng gbete a pɔ̃ sisɨn aɗɔn kpai i nitɛ, a vinaa a vibii barikinɛni i nitɛ piti, a yɛ kpaayi tɔkɨn ɓa dangdangǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Jalumooyi ai rii shɔ vinaa tɛttɔ a nyaba lumoo pɛlinɛ a koomo pɛ̃nibau, i yɛ shi kpɛlɛ aru i ntaseti nɛ shɔyɛ tosiyirɛ a ɓusɨng raaɓoonɛ a suu ɓooyɛni, i sɨnrɛ i ntasisɨn hɨmri, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Yukɔnɛ ɗɔn! yukɔnɛ aɗɔn aru koomo pɛ̃niɓaniǃ Shɔgbeteu si hã fãrã lili kɔrinɛ tɔ̃vɨnyɛ, fãrã miizarɛ, fãrã nweri, u bariki bi a fãrã tarimɛɛyi, tariyi au saa yuuni-yɛ, a tari puru. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />A dɔɔɗa gbete u vinaayi kpai i nirɛǃ&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Yupɛ̃ni latosi pɛ̃nibayi, a shɔgbeteyi isi ɓuzɨn latosiuni, a shɔ latosi zaanɛyini a gãsi shɔgbeteyi kpayi vishaanɛ a wapo kpai, i shi kpɛlɛ, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />i sɨnrɛ, aɗagbete i zɛ zɨnri yaa au shaa koomouyɛː i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Koomo wɔ ɓa naa koomo pɛ̃niɓan niɓaǃ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Kɛɗɔn i nteli zaburu ai yuu i ɗɔsɨnnɛ a sisɨn hɨmri ntanɛni, i ɗɔ shanɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Yukɔnɛ a ɗɔnǃ yukɔnɛ aɗɔn aru koomo pɛ̃niɓamniǃ Koomo gbete shɔ latosi pɛ̃nibayi kpayi vinaayi jo au tete vinaayikɔ! Ama dɔɔɗa gbete viwiyi nitɛ kpaiǃ &gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Ɔ nta yɛti purutɔ shɔgbete ɔ ɔ̃ a kolapa aru gbeteu lɛsiyɛni, shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi ɔ nta yɛti purutɔ, jashonɛyi a janyagadiyini! Aruviya Ɗalapa lɛsi Babila tɛ ayuu vigbete pɛlɔɔyɛni!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa wɔ pɛ̃niɓa u kaka ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm tuu tari pɛ̃niba au banɛ a tari vinanɛni zali a lokirɛ a wapo a shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Jinankɔ a kakani shom nɔgbete shɔyɛ loki koomo pɛ̃niɓa Babila yɛ, shɔyɛ zɛu tokɨn ɓa. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Shɔyɛ nta hmtaa waanɛ tokɨn aa yɛtini ɓa, shɔ soo tɔ̃nɛ, vigeenɛ, gãnti geenɛ, shɔ yɛ ntayi tɔɓaǃ Shɔyɛ kpaa jalumoo wɔ ko zɔ̃ng shɔpiya tɔkɨn aa yɛtini ɓa. Shɔyɛ nta vinanɛ kanɛ tokɨn a yɛtini ɓa. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Shɔyɛ zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ pitila tokɨn aa biini ɓa; shɔyɛ nta shɔ gbete tɛ su soo a shɔ gbete tɛ vɔshɔ sɔɔ i yeenya tokɨn aa yɛtini ɓa. Si jo jalumooyikɔ i kakani ayuu kotipini, ji aa vilansi nyayeekɔ a ɗaki shɔ kotipirɛ kpaiǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Shɔ lɛsi Babila aru gbete shɔ kpaa janyagadiyi a shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyi kpaa a koomouni, nn aru shɔgbete shɔ nyokiyirɛ i kpaa a kotipi kpai.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Akɨnti vim, n nta viwɔ kaa nya naa moo waanɛyi yeenya a kolapa, i ɗɔ kaanɛ a gãgã i shanɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɛli Ɗalapa nɛ! Raanɛ, bassinɛ, a kakani pɛu Ɗalapa ɓɛɛkɔ! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />U ruuyeenɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn, sɔ̃n pɛ nizɛǃ Yeeruutɛ nyo su kpantang pɛ̃niɓa au mɛɛ kotipim ruutɛ aka kpantang gbete pɛliyɛ, Ɗalapa tasiu raatɛ aru gbete nyoki u jashonɛyi vɔrɔyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />I ɓaanya sɔ̃n a gãgãni nɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɛli Ɗalapa nɛ! Zɨnri yaa au shaa koomo pɛ̃nibau u ɗɔ lapa gẽnɛ dangdang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Kɛɗɔn shɔpɛ̃ni bmati atu nɛ̃ɛ̃ti a vishɛshinɛ suru nɛ̃ɛ̃tiwi i nwesirɛ a tipi, i bassi Ɗalapa shɔgbeteu a ɗɔ-ɔ̃nɛ a lakpati. i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Nankɔ! Bɛli Ɗalapa nɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yumusinɛ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ tɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ nta yeenya wɔ a lakpati kɛ shanɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Bɛli u Ɗalapa nɛ, u jashonɛyi a shɔzɛ piti, jabɛ̃rɛ̃tiyi a shɔpɛ̃niyini piti, shɔ gbeteyi ntau setiyɛ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Kɛɗɔn n nta viwɔ kɛ kaanɛ naa moo waanɛ i yeenya, naa mii gulirɛ aɗɔ yuunɛ, naa jalɛ nyakaanɛ, n ntayirɛ i shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Bɛli Ɗalapa nɛ, aru Uɓeyelapa, u Ɗalapa shɔgbete vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛ, u kpati! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />U nta sisɨn purunɛ u nta binyatɔ̃nɛ; U basiunɛǃ Aru lee jamɛ̃rɛ̃ tɛnɛ pɛlitɛ, u su sɔɔ mabii tɛttɔ a ruuni. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Shɔ ãu fãrã lili tɔ̃vɨntɛ, ɓolong-ɓolɔng nɛu hãtɔ.&gt;&gt; (Fãrã lilim ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ Ɗalapa i vipɛlinɛ.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Bee vimnɛ: Ɗa u tasiyi susãri abiini shɔ gbete shɔ geliyi nya yumusinɛ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ tɛnɛyɛ.&gt;&gt;Ɗajashonɛlapa pɔ̃u ɓɛɛ sɔ̃n ɗɔnnɛ, &lt;&lt;Shomkɔ ɔ̃rɛ ruu Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />N nwesi au ɗɛkɨn ń basiurɛ, ama gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mɔkaa pɛlinɛ ɗɔkɔ, Nkɔng ma n jo jashonɛkɔ a ɔkɔɔni a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ gãsiyini piti, shɔgbeteyi sã Yɛsɔ vimatinɛ kpai. A bassi Ɗalapa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Aruviya ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete Yɛsɔ tasiyɛ ukɔ ã janyagadiyi kaka vishonɛ pɛlinɛrɛ.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔu Ayuu Gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n puru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ kolapa ɓelinɛ, ang zɛ gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n puru, u shɔ gẽnɛ shɔ ɓau niinɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a shɔ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ; yeeruuyi pɛ nyaba tɔ̃vɨn, tasɨnyi a nyaba tɔ̃vɨnyi. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />U janɔɔ naa ɗɛɛti yaa, a tosi salabu kpati au yuuni waanɛ, u nii wɔ ɗɔn gbete shɔ bee aɗɔn, nii gbete shɔwɔ ji zɛ ɓa see ji ukɔ sheeli. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Fãrã gbete hãyɛ shɔ kuki a kpaa. U nii nɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗanyaruubii.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Soja kolapa i gɨurɛ, i gẽ ayuu gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n puruyi, i hã fãrã lili puru ɓolong-ɓolong. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />A shɔ gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n gẽnɛ̃u nya, zali au nya piipipi shɛrɛ ɗɔn, Ɗa yɛ shaariu jo a uku a shɔ yuuni. Yɛ tasiyi raatɔ au kpati roonɛni, A Ɗalapa shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓa u sisɨn lɛsinɛ pɛ̃niba yɛ nali inabi adɔɔ a ɗɔgbete shɔ ka mii inabi yɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Au fãrã au dɔbɔ̃si shɔ bee nii mi,&lt;&lt;Kpatiyi i Kpati wɔsɔ̃n nɛ uɓeyelapayi Ɓeye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa u ɗɔshinɛ a ɗaa, a ɓaa janɔɔ gbete i ɗɔ dunɛ a konyasi nya a gãgãni nɛː &lt;&lt;Ɔ anɛ ɔ tolinya ɗɔgbete aru Ɗalapa yumusinɛ pɛ̃niɓamǃ <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Ɔ anɛ ɔ shaa kpatiyi yɔpɔ, yupɛ̃ni sojayi ɓɛɛ, sojayi ɓɛɛ, gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n ɓɛɛ a shɔ gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n genɛyi ɓɛɛni, shɔzɛ piti i yɔpɔ, foo a jalajaa ɓɛɛni, shɔpɛ̃niba a jabɛ̃rɛ̃ti ɓɛɛniǃ&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ viɓili wɔ a kpati kotipiyini ai sojayini i tolinyarɛ, aru i tasɨn a shɔu ayuu Gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n au sojayini. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ama shɔ sã viɓiliurɛ, shɔ lokiu a jahm a janyagadi nyayeenɛni gbete pɛli vibiizaanɛ a viɓilu ɗekɨn yɛni.(ji a nyaba vibiizaanɛukɔ ɗaki shɔgbeteyi nomba jasuru viɓiliu ɗɔnrɛ, a shɔgbeteyi bassi jasuru viɓiliuyɛni. Shɔ sã viɓiliurɛ a janyagadi nyayeenɛuni shɔ lokiyirɛ a suruni a yaa kanɛ a kolo yaa. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />I sojayi shɔ nyoyirɛ a zali gbete shɛ a shɔu ayuu gbɛ̃ntɛ̃n nyayɛ; kɛɗɔn janɔɔyi piti i shaayi yɔpɔ nɔgbete tesiyiyɛ.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Saa Laa Maani Ɓa Kopi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa kɛ nɔnɛ a kolapa, sã saanyajaa too gbikiri-gbikiri au sɔ̃nya ɓa a saganya ni au naa. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />A sã sɔɔ pɛ̃nibaurɛ, sɔɔ gbete si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ̃ wakɔ, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔlanɛyi kpati ko japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ, Ɗajashonɛlapa maurɛ a saganyau ni saa laa maani ɓa kopi. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Ɗajashonɛlapa lokiurɛ a ɓuzɨn too gbikiri-gbikiri au sɔ̃nya ɓanni, ɓaanya toou a rɛunya rɛ, nɔgbete yɛ ɗaki shɔ tipiyi tɔkɨn ɓa, see saa laa maani ɓa kopi tɛɛtɛ, akɨnti vim shɔyɛ yaau naa sɔ̃ntɔ sekaa.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ lakpatiyi, a shɔgbeteyi ɔ̃li aɗɔnyɛ shɔ ãi kaka ruuyeerinɛ tɛttɔ a shɔ yuuni, ang zɛ wɔsɔ̃n suruyi shɔgbete shɔ nyoyi aru i shi a Yesɔ knti, a Ɗalapa nyaruubii, ikɔi i ji bassi viɓili pɛ̃nibau ɓa au jasuru ni ɓa. I ji tɛ viɓili pɛ̃nibau vitasinɛ ɓa ai nɔkɨn ni ko ai naani ɓa, i sɔɔ sɔ̃n a suruni, i roo kpati a Kirisini saa laa maani ɓa kopi. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Gãsi shɔgbeteyi vɔliyɛ i ji sɔɔ tɔkɨn a suruni ɓa, see knti saa laa maani ɓa kopiu tɛɛpɛtɔ.) Shomkɔ pɛ ɗaa gbete shɔ gaa yusinɛ a saa yɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ɗalapa u tasiyi susãritɔ bi shɔgbeteyi gaa yunɛ saa a shɔ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni. Vɔnɛ au pɛsiyɛ u kaka ɓa ai yuuni ɓa; i yɛ ɔ̃ shɔlansi Ɗalapa a e Kirisini, i yɛ roo kpati awuni saa laa maani ɓa kopi.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗashaari Shɔ a Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ yuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />A knti saa laa maani ɓa kopin kɛ tɛɛnɛ, shɔyɛ yaa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ naatɔ a jahmni, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Yɛ arɛ u ɗaki shɔ kotipi gbeteyi satitɛttɔ kpai yɛ, kɛ ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Gog a magog, Japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ yɛ toliyinyarɛ kpai aru sɨn tanɛ, i yɛ sha naa seseli a nya ɓooti wapo. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />I sãti a kotipi piti i knti ɗɔgbete Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi tolinya a koomo pɛ̃niba au ɔriyiyɛ. Ama yaa shɛ a kolapa a shaayirɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Kɛɗɔn shɔlanɛ au ɗakiyiyɛ, shɔ tuurɛ shɔ lokiu a yaa kanɛ a kolo yaa, aɗɔgbete shɔ loki viɓiliu a janyagadi nyayeenɛwi siyɛ, a ɗɔwakɔ i yɛ ɓooraa niti a zɨnbani dangdang.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruuyeenɛ Nawasinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ lakpati puru pɛ̃niɓa a shɔu ɔ̃ au yuuyɛni. Kotipi a konyasini i nirɛ au ɗekɨn ni, shɔ ji zɛyi tɔkɨn ɓa. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ shɔ gbeteyi vɔlitɛ shɔpɛ̃nibayi a pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛni piti i shilitɛ a ɗekɨn lakpati. Labeenɛyi ɓelirɛ, kɛɗɔn labeenɛ wɔ ɓeli sɔ̃nrɛ, kɛ labeenɛ suru. Shɔ yeeri shɔ gbeteyi vɔlitɛ i ruu jo a vigbeteyi pɛlitɛttɔyɛ, ji naa gbete shɔ bee a labeenɛwi yɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Kɛɗɔn wapo shɛshi shɔ gbeteyi vɔli au ɓuzɨn rɛ. Vɔrɔ a saayi kotipi ikɔma i shɛshi shɔ gbeteyi vɔli aɗɔnrɛ jo. I kpai shɔ yeeriyi ruu jo nɔgbete i vishonɛ sãyɛ. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Kɛɗɔn vɔrɔ à saayi ni shɔ loki a yaa kanɛ. (Yaa kanɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vɔnɛ ɓa ziti.) <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Shɔgbeteyi shɔ ji kpayi nii ɓa a ɓuzɨn labeenɛ surunni ɓa, shɔ lokiyirɛ a ɓuzɨn yaa kanɛ.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kolapa Sɔɔ a Kotipi Sɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Kɛɗɔn n zɛ kolapa sɔɔ a kotipi sɔɔ, kolapa gaanɛ a kotipi gaanɛ i nirɛ, wapo wɔ tɔɓa. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />N zɛ koomo wɔsɔ-wɔsɔrɛ, Urushalima sɔɔ, kɛ nɔnɛ a kolapa a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, shɔ masiu bitɛ naa su sɔɔ au kpaakɛ ɓɛvɔ yɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />N nta yeenya pɛ̃niba kɛ shanɛ a lakpati nɛː&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim Ɗalapa ɗɔgbete ɔ̃yɛ pɛ a shɔzɛ ɗɔbii! Yɛ ɔ̃ a ikɔ ni, i yɛ ɔ̃kɛ u shɔbiiyi, Ɗalapa au yuu yɛ ɔ̃ ayini, ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ i Ɗalapa. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Yɛ sɔ̃riyi murutɔ ai nɔɔyini kpai. Ruu vɔnɛ yɛ ɔ̃ toti ɓa, ko sisɨn hɨmnɛ ko sɨnɛ ko kɔnɛ yɛ ɔ̃ toti ɓa. vi gbaaliyi i tɛɛtɛ gboti.<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Kɛɗɔn shɔ gbeteu ɔ̃ a lakpti shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Dɔdɔrim n pɛli vitɛ sɔɔ kpai! A gelin sɔ̃nnɛ,&lt;&lt;Bee vimnɛ,&lt;&lt;Ruum pɛ nizɛ kɔ, nɔgbete shɔ ã sisɨn aɗɔn.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />A shanɛ, nankɔ! Nkɔ ɔ̃rɛ gɨn-gɨn a sɔ̃sinɛ, gaanɛ a yisinɛ, shɔu nta sutu miiyɛ, n yɛn ãu naatɔ u ɓoo mii a shãrã mii suru au ã miiyɛ sho viwɔ ɓa. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Shɔu Ɗa kɛ sharuunɛ yɛ kpaa vivɔ shaanɛtɔ ang naani: n yɛn ɔ̃yi Ɗalapa, i yɛ ɔ̃kɛ majaayi. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ama shɔ pnzɛyi, shɔyi sã rumanɛ ɓa, shɔ vizara pɛlinɛ, shɔ yuuvɔ nyonɛyi, shɔ gbeteyi roo a shɔ su ko a shɔ vɔshɔni, shɔ vi gãnki pɛlinɛyi, shɔ gbeteyi bassi jaɗayi, a shɔ nyayeenɛni kpai, i yɛ kpaa ɗɔ ɔ̃nɛ a yaa kanɛ a kolo yaa, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vɔnɛ ɓa ziti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urushalima Sɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Gbete atette Ɗajashonɛlapayi manzii ai piiyi shɔ yisi a yukɔnɛ au wasinaa manzii i ang ɗɔbii i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Anɛ n yɛn tasɔɔ su sɔɔtɔ, Jamɛrɛ̃ ɓeso. <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗa suru nɔ ang yuu, a ɗajashonɛlapa tunrɛ yɛnɛ kɔpɔ pɛ̃niba gbeteu yuu shinɛ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm. A tasing Urushalima, koomo wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ kɛ nɔnɛ a kolapa shɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />u ɗɔ kɔlinɛ a Ɗalapa bassinɛni, Koomou koli naa tari gbeteu saa yuuniyɛ, naa yasipa, wasak naa takolo. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />U kãsiri ɗɔn raki, nyaba ɗɔn kopi atu ziti kopishɔpiya Ɗajashonɛlapayi aɗɔ ganɛ. A nyaba koomoyiwi shɔ bee laduru Israila kopi atu ziti i nii aɗɔn. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kopikapiya nyaba si taati ɗɔn: taati a gɨnri, taati aka nagang, taati aka nakɨn, taati aka paa. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Shɔ maa gɨn-gɨn koomou a tariyi kopi atu ziti, ai bikɔ jashonɛ jamɛrɛ̃yi kopi atu ziti shɔ bee nii ɗɔn. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ɗajashonɛlapa au nwanya a nkɔni u labaa vitesinɛ e tarimɛɛ ɗɔn au teesi koomou, u nyaba, au kãsiri awuni. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Koomou kopikapiya zali, u raki au ɓuzɨn ni sɔ̃nji zali. Ɗajashonɛlapa teesi koomourɛ au labaa teesinɛuni: sipɛ meli laa maani ɓa kopi atu maani u raki, u ɓusɨng au yuu shinɛni zali kpai. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ɗajashonɛlapa teesi kãsiriu sɔ̃njirɛ, u shinɛ si dɔɔ 216, pɛlivishonɛ ji a vi teesinɛ nɔgbete shɔ teesi vi a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Shɔ maa kãsiriu a tariu shɔ ɓaanɛ jasipa, koomou shɔ maa a tarimɛɛ au nɔɔ, wasak naa zɛlivini. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Gɨn-gɨn kãsiri koomou shɔ bariki a zɔng tarimɛɛyi toti, gɨn-gɨn kãsiri koomou shɔ gaa pɛ a tari jasipa, gbete shɔ pɛsiyɛ shɔ ɓaanɛ sappaya, u shɔ taati u zɔng totto u niinɛ aget, shɔ nɛ̃ɛ̃ti tari saa u niinɛ zumurudu, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />e maani tariu saa yuuni shɔ ɓaanɛ onis, e maangbete karnɛliyan, e maanzii tarimɛɛ miiroo shɔ ɓaanɛ kpat, e maantaati lariki shɔ ɓaanɛ beril, e maannɛ̃ɛ̃ti tari miiroo shɔ ɓaanɛ topas, e kopi tari saa shɔ ɓaanɛ kalsidoni, e kopi atu gbete tari lariki shɔ ɓaanɛ tokpis, e kopi atu ziti tari miizari shɔ ɓaanɛ ametes. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Nyaba kopi atu zitiwi shɔ pɛli a tari puru kopi atu ziti; ko-pi nyaba shɔpiya shɔ pɛli a tari puru gbete. Nyaba koomo pɛ̃nibau shɔ pɛli a tarimɛɛ au nɔɔ kpai, tuu shɔ nɔkɨn naa zɛlivini.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />N ji zɛ Wɛrɛ Ɗa ɓa a koomouni ɓa, aruviya Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa shɔ gbete vi tɛu kaka ɓayɛ a jamɛ̃rɛ̃ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ koomou wɛrɛ Ɗa. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Koomou ji kã ɗaa ɓa ko shɛlɛ u koli au ɓuzɨn niɓa aru Ɗalapa bassinɛ ukɔ kolirɛ aɗɔn, jamɛ̃rɛ̃ pɛ ukɔ u pitila. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Shɔ kotipi i yɛ rajo a koomou ɗɔsẽsẽkɔ. Kpati kotipiyi i yɛ n-tiyi vinaa kiriri jo koomoukɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Nyaba koomou shɔ yɛ yaa ɓelinɛ niti niti; shɔ yɛ kukki ɓa dangdang; aruviya zɨmba yɛ ɔ̃ tɔɓa a ɗɔuni ɓa. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Shɔ kotipiyi i yɛ n ti vi pɛ̃niba ai vinaa ni ji a koomoukɔ. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ama vigbeteu ɓa wɔsɔ wɔsɔ ɓa yɛ to koomou ɓa, ko shɔgbeteu pɛli viyusẽẽ ko shɔ nyayeenɛ yɛ to koomou ɓa, see jo shɔ gbete shɔ beeyi nii a labeenɛ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ suru kɔ sheeli i yɛ to koomourɛ.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ɗajashonɛlapa tasing wɔsɔ̃n ɓooti mii suru ãnɛ, aɗɔ kolinɛ naa takolo, aɗɔ zɛɛnɛ a lakpati Ɗalapa a jamɛ̃rɛ̃ni <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />a ɗɔ zɛɛnɛ atette nyaba lanɛ koomo. ko-pi ɓootiu kapiya laa gbete ã suru ɗɔn, au rɛɛ jaa ɓa kopi atu ziti a saa, ko-pi shɛlɛ shɔpiya rɛɛ jaa ɓa gbete, gapa laau sɔ̃n shɔ shɔ gatinɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Vigbete Ɗalapa wiritɛttɔ yɛ shɔ yɛ kpaa ɓa a koomouni ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Ɗalapa lakpati a shɔ jamɛ̃rɛ̃ni yɛ ɔ̃ a koomowakɔ, u jawɛrɛyi i yɛ bassiutɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />I yɛ zɛu nɔkɨntɔ, shɔ yɛ beeu nii ai nɔkɨnyi ni. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Zɨmba yɛ ɔ̃ tɔkɨn ɓa, i yɛ kã pitila ko ɗaa sẽsẽ tɔkɨn ɓa, aruviya Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa ukɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ i ɗɔsẽsẽ, i yɛ ɔ̃ naa kpati i sã shɔ dangdang.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yɛsɔ Anɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Kɛɗɔn Ɗajashonɛlapa gelin nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ruum pɛ nizɛ yɛtɛtɔ nɔgbete shɔ ã sisɨn ɗɔn. Uɓeyelapa Ɗalapa au ãu janyagadiyi u Ɗa suru, shou ɗajashonɛlapatɛ aru u tasi u jawɛrɛyi vi gbete yɛ pɛli ɗekɨn sekaa.<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Weshoo pɛ! N yɛn ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔkɔkɔ ɓa n atɔ! Ɗa u tasi shɔ gbeteyi gɨn janyagadiyi ruu gbete i bee a labeenɛm susãri a biini!<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Nkɔng Yɔhana, n ntatɛ n zɛ vimiyi tɛttɔ kpai, akɨnti gbete n nta vimiyitɛ n zɛyi sɔ̃ntɛ, ɗajashonɛlapa au tasing vimiyi yɛ n nwesi au ɗekɨn, n kasiu bassinɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ama a gelin nɛ,&lt;&lt;Mɔkaa pɛlinɛ nankɔ! N pɛ jo jawɛrɛkɔ a mɔkɔni a mɛzɔyi janyagadiyini piti a shɔ gbeteyi gɨn ruu labeenɛmni kpai. Bassi Ɗalapa! <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />A gelin nɛ, &lt;&lt;Mokaa kukki ruu e janyagadiyi sha a labeenɛm nɛ, aruviya ɗaa ɓatɛ maani vim piti kpai yɛ pɛlitɔ. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Shɔ gbete pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ u yɛ ɗekɨn a vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛni, shɔu pɛli kpantang u yɛ ɗekɨn a kpantang pɛlinɛni; shɔu pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng u yɛ ɗekɨn a vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛni, shɔ gbeteu kɛ ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɔ̃tɛ kaa jazɨng akɔrɔ u yɛ ɗekɨn a ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesɔ shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Weshopɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa n atɔǃ N yɛn n ti n kaatɔ, n ã kopiya jo nɔgbete pɛli vishonɛyɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />N kɔn ɔ̃rɛ gɨn-gɨn a sɔ̃sinɛ, gaanɛ au yisinɛni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Ɗalapa u tasi shɔ gbeteyi sɔkiyi fãrã gbɛm tɛ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ susãri a biini, i kaka ɗɔn i shaa nɔlaa a laa gbete ã suruyɛ, i sɔɔ nyajaa i to koomou rɛ. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ama shɔ gbeteyi a koomo ɓili ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ shɔ vizara pɛlinɛyi, shɔ vigãnki pɛlinɛyi, shɔ gbeteyi roo a shɔ soni ko a shɔ vɔshɔni, shɔ yuuvɔ nyonɛyi, shɔ gbeteyi bassi jaɗayi, shɔ nyayeenɛ a shanɛ a shonɛni.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />&lt;&lt;N kɔng Yesɔ n shong ɗajashonɛlapa u gelɔɔ vimiyitɔ ɔ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi kpai. Nkɔng Dauda jawuru, n kɔng sɛgadi au kɔliyɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Ɗa suru a su sɔɔ i shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Anɛ!&gt;&gt; ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Kopiya au nta vim kpai ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Anɛ!&gt;&gt; Anɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Shɔ gbeteu nta sutu yɛ, u anɛ; kɛ kasinɛyɛ u tɛ mi suru ãnɛ weze.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyayisinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />N kɔng Yɔhana n gɔ̃ kopiya yushoo, shɔ gbeteu kɛ nta ruu gbete janyagadiyi nwa a labeenɛm nɛ, kɛ pɔ̃ viwɔɔnɛ ɗɔn, Ɗalapa yɛ pɔ̃siu raaɓoonɛ gbete shɔ bee a labeenɛm ɗɔn. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Shɔ gbeteu kɛ zɔ̃ viwɔɔnɛ a vigbete janyagadiyi bee a labeenɛm nɛ, Ɗalapa yɛ zɔ̃ viwɔɔ jo ai nɔlaa gbete ã suru yɛ a shɔ koomo wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni, nagbete shɔ tasi a labeemkɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Yesɔ shɔ gbeteu shi akɨnti vim kpai, shanɛ,&lt;&lt;Nizɛ! Yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa dɔkɔkɔ ɓa n atɔ!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Nankɔ. Anɛ, Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ! <verse eid="REV 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Mɛnɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ̃ a kopiyani.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>